e pill)\", L\"位置（或拖动胶囊）\"},\r\n    {L\"Place (the bar is at the top)\", L\"位置（栏位于顶部）\"},\r\n    {L\"Place (the notches are at the top)\", L\"位置（刘海在顶部）\"},\r\n    {L\"Place and icons per app\", L\"每个应用的位置和图标\"},\r\n    {L\"Plan: \", L\"计划：\"},\r\n    {L\"Power\", L\"电源\"},\r\n    {L\"Power button\", L\"电源按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Power button (sleep, restart, shut down)\", L\"电源按钮（睡眠、重启、关机）\"},\r\n    {L\"Power draw\", L\"功率\"},\r\n    {L\"Power options\", L\"电源选项\"},\r\n    {L\"Power plan\", L\"电源计划\"},\r\n    {L\"Press\", L\"按键\"},\r\n    {L\"Press the keys\", L\"请按键\"},\r\n    {L\"Press the keys (Tab moves on)…\", L\"按下按键（Tab 跳到下一项）…\"},\r\n    {L\"Pressing Win+A opens the island's control center instead of Windows'\", L\"按 Win+A 时打开灵动岛的控制中心，而不是 Windows 的\"},\r\n    {L\"Pressing Win+N opens the island's notifications instead of Windows'\", L\"按 Win+N 时打开灵动岛的通知，而不是 Windows 的\"},\r\n    {L\"Pressure\", L\"气压\"},\r\n    {L\"Privacy\", L\"隐私\"},\r\n    {L\"Processor\", L\"处理器\"},\r\n    {L\"Processor use (CPU)\", L\"处理器使用率 (CPU)\"},\r\n    {L\"Profile \", L\"配置文件\"},\r\n    {L\"Profiles\", L\"配置文件\"},\r\n    {L\"Profiles button (switch profiles)\", L\"配置文件按钮（切换配置文件）\"},\r\n    {L\"Program, file, folder, link or ms-settings:\", L\"程序、文件、文件夹、链接或 ms-settings:\"},\r\n    {L\"Programs and Features\", L\"程序和功能\"},\r\n    {L\"Project\", L\"投影\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a button on the pill that locks the PC\", L\"在胶囊上放置用于锁定电脑的按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a button on the pill that opens Calculator\", L\"在胶囊上放置用于打开计算器的按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a button on the pill that opens File Explorer\", L\"在胶囊上放置用于打开文件资源管理器的按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a button on the pill that opens Task Manager\", L\"在胶囊上放置用于打开任务管理器的按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a button on the pill that opens Windows' Settings\", L\"在胶囊上放置用于打开 Windows 设置的按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a button on the pill that opens the Start button's right-click menu (the one of Win+X)\", L\"在胶囊上放置一个按钮，用于打开“开始”按钮的右键菜单（即 Win+X 菜单）\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a button on the pill that opens the accessibility options\", L\"在胶囊上放置用于打开辅助功能选项的按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a button on the pill that opens the clipboard history\", L\"在胶囊上放置用于打开剪贴板历史记录的按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a button on the pill that opens the emoji panel\", L\"在胶囊上放置用于打开表情符号面板的按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a button on the pill that opens the on-screen keyboard\", L\"在胶囊上放置用于打开屏幕键盘的按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a button on the pill that shows or hides the touch keyboard\", L\"在胶囊上放置用于显示或隐藏触摸键盘的按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a button on the pill that shows the desktop\", L\"在胶囊上放置用于显示桌面的按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a button on the pill that takes a screenshot\", L\"在胶囊上放置用于截取屏幕的按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a button on the pill that turns live captions on\", L\"在胶囊上放置用于开启实时字幕的按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a button on the pill to cast the screen\", L\"在胶囊上放置用于投射屏幕的按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a button on the pill to choose the display mode\", L\"在胶囊上放置用于选择投影模式的按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a button on the pill to start, stop or reload komorebi\", L\"在胶囊上放置用于启动、停止或重新加载 komorebi 的按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a one-click Airplane mode button on the pill\", L\"在胶囊上放置一键飞行模式按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a one-click Bluetooth button on the pill\", L\"在胶囊上放置一键 Bluetooth 按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a one-click Mobile hotspot button on the pill\", L\"在胶囊上放置一键移动热点按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a one-click Night light button on the pill\", L\"在胶囊上放置一键夜间模式按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts a one-click Wi-Fi and network button on the pill\", L\"在胶囊上放置一键 Wi-Fi 和网络按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts previous, play and next buttons right on the pill\", L\"直接在胶囊上放置上一首、播放和下一首按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Puts the clock in the middle with the other items around it\", L\"将时钟放在中间，其他项目排在两侧\"},\r\n    {L\"Rain\", L\"雨\"},\r\n    {L\"Rain chance\", L\"降雨概率\"},\r\n    {L\"Rainbow\", L\"彩虹\"},\r\n    {L\"Reading…\", L\"正在读取…\"},\r\n    {L\"Record shortcut\", L\"录制快捷键\"},\r\n    {L\"Recycle Bin\", L\"回收站\"},\r\n    {L\"Recycle Bin appears\", L\"回收站显示\"},\r\n    {L\"Red\", L\"红色\"},\r\n    {L\"Remember my choice (it's in the island's settings)\", L\"记住我的选择（可在灵动岛设置中更改）\"},\r\n    {L\"Repeat\", L\"重复\"},\r\n    {L\"Reply\", L\"回复\"},\r\n    {L\"Report a bug or suggest an idea, GitHub tells you when it comes out\", L\"报告问题或提出建议，发布时 GitHub 会通知你\"},\r\n    {L\"Reset\", L\"重置\"},\r\n    {L\"Restart\", L\"重启\"},\r\n    {L\"Restart now?\", L\"现在重启？\"},\r\n    {L\"Resting the mouse on an item opens its panel, and it closes a moment after the mouse leaves. Buttons that do something still need a click; a click keeps the panel open\", L\"鼠标在项目上停留会打开它的面板，鼠标离开片刻后面板关闭。执行操作的按钮仍需点击；点击可让面板保持打开\"},\r\n    {L\"Restore what changed\", L\"恢复所做的更改\"},\r\n    {L\"Resume\", L\"继续\"},\r\n    {L\"Right\", L\"右\"},\r\n    {L\"Ring with the battery's charge\", L\"显示电量的圆环\"},\r\n    {L\"Room at the pill's ends\", L\"胶囊两端的空间\"},\r\n    {L\"Room between the bars\", L\"音频条间距\"},\r\n    {L\"Rounds the corners where the bar meets the screen, like a screen's own round corners\", L\"把栏与屏幕相接处的角变圆，就像屏幕本身的圆角\"},\r\n    {L\"Rows\", L\"行\"},\r\n    {L\"Run a command line\", L\"运行命令行\"},\r\n    {L\"Runs in cmd.exe without a window; a terminal shows only if it fails.\", L\"在 cmd.exe 中无窗口运行；只有失败时才会显示终端。\"},\r\n    {L\"Safe to remove\", L\"可以安全移除\"},\r\n    {L\"Same as main: changes here apply to it too · + creates this monitor's profile\", L\"与主岛相同：这里的更改也适用于主岛 · + 为此显示器创建配置\"},\r\n    {L\"Same as the main one\", L\"与主灵动岛相同\"},\r\n    {L\"Save\", L\"保存\"},\r\n    {L\"Save  (Enter)\", L\"保存  (Enter)\"},\r\n    {L\"Save Windows' icons\", L\"保存 Windows 的图标\"},\r\n    {L\"Save Windows' icons puts a picture of every icon in the folder, named after it (wifi.png, battery-5.png...): replace the ones you want, and they show a moment later\", L\"“保存 Windows 的图标”会把每个图标的图片放进文件夹，以图标名称命名（wifi.png、battery-5.png...）：替换你想要的图片，稍后就会显示\"},\r\n    {L\"Save current here\", L\"把当前设置保存到这里\"},\r\n    {L\"Save current settings\", L\"保存当前设置\"},\r\n    {L\"Save the island's logs\", L\"保存灵动岛日志\"},\r\n    {L\"Save...\", L\"保存...\"},\r\n    {L\"Saved \\u2713\", L\"已保存 ✓\"},\r\n    {L\"Saved.\", L\"已保存。\"},\r\n    {L\"Saves a backup file or loads one; Reset puts every setting back to its default (clicked twice)\", L\"保存或载入备份文件；“重置”会把所有设置恢复为默认值（需点两次）\"},\r\n    {L\"Saving Windows' icons…\", L\"正在保存 Windows 的图标…\"},\r\n    {L\"Saving…\", L\"正在保存…\"},\r\n    {L\"Scales only the icons on the pill (their room too)\", L\"仅缩放胶囊上的图标（以及它们的空间）\"},\r\n    {L\"Scales only the texts on the pill: the clock, percentages and titles\", L\"仅缩放胶囊上的文字：时钟、百分比和标题\"},\r\n    {L\"Scales the control center, calendar and other panels\", L\"缩放控制中心、日历等面板\"},\r\n    {L\"Scales the pill, icons and panels together\", L\"同时缩放胶囊、图标和面板\"},\r\n    {L\"Screen\", L\"屏幕\"},\r\n    {L\"Screen brightness\", L\"屏幕亮度\"},\r\n    {L\"Screen brightness (the mouse wheel changes it)\", L\"屏幕亮度（用鼠标滚轮调节）\"},\r\n    {L\"Screens\", L\"屏幕\"},\r\n    {L\"Screenshot\", L\"截图\"},\r\n    {L\"Screenshot notifications open the picture (in Explorer)\", L\"截图通知打开图片（在资源管理器中）\"},\r\n    {L\"Scrolling\", L\"滚动\"},\r\n    {L\"Scrolling on the player skips songs instead of changing the volume\", L\"在播放器上滚动会切歌，而不是调节音量\"},\r\n    {L\"Search\", L\"搜索\"},\r\n    {L\"Search apps\", L\"搜索应用\"},\r\n    {L\"Search here (a name or *.pdf)\", L\"在此搜索（名称或 *.pdf）\"},\r\n    {L\"Search results\", L\"搜索结果\"},\r\n    {L\"Second screen only\", L\"仅第二屏幕\"},\r\n    {L\"Seconds\", L\"秒\"},\r\n    {L\"Seconds the pill waits after the mouse leaves before it hides\", L\"鼠标离开后胶囊等待多少秒再隐藏\"},\r\n    {L\"See it in a terminal\", L\"在终端中查看\"},\r\n    {L\"See what's new in this version\", L\"查看此版本的新功能\"},\r\n    {L\"See-through bar\", L\"透明栏\"},\r\n    {L\"See-through blurred pill with a bright edge, needs Windows transparency\", L\"带亮边的透明模糊胶囊，需要开启 Windows 透明效果\"},\r\n    {L\"See-through only on the desktop\", L\"仅在桌面上透明\"},\r\n    {L\"Separator line · drag to move · click to remove\", L\"分隔线 · 拖动以移动 · 点击以删除\"},\r\n    {L\"Set a timer\", L\"设置计时器\"},\r\n    {L\"Set an alarm\", L\"设置闹钟\"},\r\n    {L\"Sets the order of day, month and year when the date shows\", L\"显示日期时设置日、月、年的先后顺序\"},\r\n    {L\"Settings\", L\"设置\"},\r\n    {L\"Settings back to their defaults\", L\"设置已恢复为默认值\"},\r\n    {L\"Setup assistant\", L\"设置向导\"},\r\n    {L\"Shared memory\", L\"共享内存\"},\r\n    {L\"Shelf\", L\"暂存架\"},\r\n    {L\"Shelf for files\", L\"文件暂存架\"},\r\n    {L\"Shelf holds\", L\"暂存架容量\"},\r\n    {L\"Short\", L\"短\"},\r\n    {L\"Shortcut: let clicks through the pill\", L\"快捷键：让点击穿透胶囊\"},\r\n    {L\"Shortcuts\", L\"快捷键\"},\r\n    {L\"Shortcuts to programs and files (or command lines) you add, with their own icons, a click away in their panel; any of them can be a button on the pill or have a keyboard shortcut (set in its editor)\", L\"你添加的程序和文件（或命令行）的快捷方式，带有它们自己的图标，在其面板中一键打开；任何一个都可以成为胶囊上的按钮，或设置键盘快捷键（在其编辑器中设置）\"},\r\n    {L\"Show\", L\"显示\"},\r\n    {L\"Show %zu hidden\", L\"显示 %zu 个已隐藏的事件\"},\r\n    {L\"Show VLC 3 from its window's title\", L\"通过窗口标题显示 VLC 3\"},\r\n    {L\"Show all\", L\"显示全部\"},\r\n    {L\"Show desktop\", L\"显示桌面\"},\r\n    {L\"Show what they say\", L\"显示通知内容\"},\r\n    {L\"Show what's copied (a bubble under the pill)\", L\"显示复制的内容（胶囊下方的气泡）\"},\r\n    {L\"Showers\", L\"阵雨\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows a banner on the pill when a notification arrives\", L\"收到通知时在胶囊上显示横幅\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows a bubble under the pill with what you just copied\", L\"在胶囊下方用气泡显示刚复制的内容\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows a mark and the app name while the mic, camera or location is used\", L\"麦克风、摄像头或位置被使用时，显示标记和应用名称\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows a notice each time a USB drive is plugged in\", L\"每次插入 U 盘时显示提示\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows a notice when the battery goes under 20% and under 10%\", L\"电量低于 20% 和低于 10% 时显示提示\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows a notice when the charger is plugged in\", L\"接通充电器时显示提示\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows a notice when you turn Do not disturb on or off\", L\"你开启或关闭勿扰模式时显示提示\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows a notice with the device's name when Bluetooth audio connects\", L\"蓝牙音频连接时显示带设备名称的提示\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows an icon on the pill for each app with notifications\", L\"为每个有通知的应用在胶囊上显示图标\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows an icon to open or eject plugged-in USB drives\", L\"显示图标，用于打开或弹出已插入的 U 盘\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows bars that move with the sound that is playing\", L\"显示随正在播放的声音跳动的音柱\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows how busy the processor is\", L\"显示处理器的占用率\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows how long until the next event, alarm, timer or Pomodoro part\", L\"显示距离下一个事件、闹钟、计时器或番茄钟阶段还有多久\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows how much memory is in use\", L\"显示正在使用的内存量\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows how much video memory is in use\", L\"显示正在使用的显存量\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows komorebi's workspaces and layout on the pill, a menu changes it\", L\"在胶囊上显示 komorebi 的工作区和布局，可通过菜单更改\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows notices for the charger, low battery, Bluetooth audio and Do not disturb\", L\"显示充电器、电量低、Bluetooth 音频和勿扰模式的提示\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows pending app and Windows updates from winget and Windows Update\", L\"显示 winget 和 Windows Update 提供的待更新应用和系统更新\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows small bubbles with names and app notifications on hover\", L\"悬停时显示带名称和应用通知的小气泡\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows the battery icon on the pill\", L\"在胶囊上显示电池图标\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows the control center's icon, click for Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, volume and more\", L\"显示控制中心图标，点击可打开 Wi-Fi、Bluetooth、音量等\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows the cover and the song title on the pill\", L\"在胶囊上显示封面和歌曲标题\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows the current keyboard language, like the Windows indicator\", L\"显示当前键盘语言，类似 Windows 的输入指示器\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows the current upload and download speed\", L\"显示当前的上传和下载速度\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows the extra clocks you added in Windows\", L\"显示你在 Windows 中添加的附加时钟\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows the icon and name of the app in focus on this monitor\", L\"显示此显示器上当前焦点应用的图标和名称\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows the keys that let clicks through, click them to record a combination\", L\"显示让点击穿透的按键，点击它们可录制组合键\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows the minimize keys, click them to record a new combination\", L\"显示最小化快捷键，点击后可录制新的组合键\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows the notifications\", L\"显示通知\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows the number and name of the virtual desktop for a moment when you switch to it, also when the island is minimized\", L\"切换到某个虚拟桌面时，短暂显示它的编号和名称，灵动岛最小化时也会显示\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows the playing song or video with its cover and controls\", L\"显示正在播放的歌曲或视频及其封面和控制按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows the screen brightness, scroll the wheel on it to change\", L\"显示屏幕亮度，在其上滚动滚轮即可调节\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows the time on the pill\", L\"在胶囊上显示时间\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows the virtual desktops, scroll the wheel on it to switch; a click opens their list, where the pencil renames one (Windows 11 24H2 and later)\", L\"显示虚拟桌面，在其上滚动滚轮即可切换；点击会打开桌面列表，用铅笔可以重命名（Windows 11 24H2 及更高版本）\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows the volume icon, click for the volume panel\", L\"显示音量图标，点击打开音量面板\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows the weather, it needs an internet connection\", L\"显示天气，需要联网\"},\r\n    {L\"Shows this action in the power button's menu; if only one is on, a click on the button runs it\", L\"在电源按钮菜单中显示此操作；如果只开启一项，点击按钮即执行\"},\r\n    {L\"Shrinks the pill to a thin line on the screen edge when idle\", L\"空闲时将胶囊收缩为屏幕边缘的细线\"},\r\n    {L\"Shut down\", L\"关机\"},\r\n    {L\"Shut down now?\", L\"现在关机？\"},\r\n    {L\"Sign out\", L\"注销\"},\r\n    {L\"Sign out now?\", L\"现在注销？\"},\r\n    {L\"Simple\", L\"简单\"},\r\n    {L\"Size\", L\"大小\"},\r\n    {L\"Sizes\", L\"大小\"},\r\n    {L\"Skip\", L\"跳过\"},\r\n    {L\"Sky\", L\"天空\"},\r\n    {L\"Sleep\", L\"睡眠\"},\r\n    {L\"Slide\", L\"滑动\"},\r\n    {L\"Small\", L\"小\"},\r\n    {L\"Smallest first\", L\"最小的在前\"},\r\n    {L\"Smooth bars (like the iPhone)\", L\"平滑条形（像 iPhone 一样）\"},\r\n    {L\"Smoothness of the animations, matching the screen or a fixed rate\", L\"动画的流畅度，与屏幕刷新率一致或使用固定帧率\"},\r\n    {L\"Snooze\", L\"稍后提醒\"},\r\n    {L\"Snoozed: shows again in 5 minutes\", L\"已暂缓：5 分钟后再次显示\"},\r\n    {L\"Snow\", L\"雪\"},\r\n    {L\"Snow showers\", L\"阵雪\"},\r\n    {L\"Song lyrics\", L\"歌词\"},\r\n    {L\"Song lyrics (goes online: lrclib.net)\", L\"歌词（需联网：lrclib.net）\"},\r\n    {L\"Sort by\", L\"排序方式\"},\r\n    {L\"Sound\", L\"声音\"},\r\n    {L\"Sound output\", L\"声音输出\"},\r\n    {L\"Space\", L\"空格\"},\r\n    {L\"Speed\", L\"速度\"},\r\n    {L\"Speeds up or slows down the animations, on every monitor\", L\"加快或减慢动画速度，对所有显示器生效\"},\r\n    {L\"Splits the island into notches against the top edge, around the camera; the Island and Fixed styles each keep their own\", L\"将灵动岛分成贴着顶部边缘的刘海，围绕摄像头；灵动岛样式和固定样式各自保留自己的设置\"},\r\n    {L\"Square\", L\"直角\"},\r\n    {L\"Stands the pill up on the left and right edges (not with notches)\", L\"在左右边缘时让胶囊竖立显示（有缺口时不可用）\"},\r\n    {L\"Start\", L\"开始\"},\r\n    {L\"Starts over in\", L\"重置倒计时\"},\r\n    {L\"Status\", L\"状态\"},\r\n    {L\"Status notices: charger, low battery, Bluetooth audio, Do not disturb\", L\"状态提示：充电器、低电量、蓝牙音频、免打扰\"},\r\n    {L\"Stay over borderless full-screen apps\", L\"在无边框全屏应用上保持显示\"},\r\n    {L\"Sticky keys\", L\"粘滞键\"},\r\n    {L\"Stop\", L\"停止\"},\r\n    {L\"Stop keeping it open\", L\"取消保持打开\"},\r\n    {L\"Stopped\", L\"已停止\"},\r\n    {L\"Stops Windows' own banners so you only see the island's\", L\"屏蔽 Windows 自带的横幅，只显示灵动岛的\"},\r\n    {L\"Stopwatch\", L\"秒表\"},\r\n    {L\"Style\", L\"样式\"},\r\n    {L\"Style (the options of the style chosen under it)\", L\"样式（所选样式的选项在其下方）\"},\r\n    {L\"Sure?\", L\"确定？\"},\r\n    {L\"Switches, adds, renames, updates or deletes your profiles\", L\"切换、添加、重命名、更新或删除配置文件\"},\r\n    {L\"System\", L\"系统\"},\r\n    {L\"System sounds (notifications)\", L\"系统声音（通知）\"},\r\n    {L\"Tabler (online)\", L\"Tabler（在线）\"},\r\n    {L\"Task\", L\"任务\"},\r\n    {L\"Task Manager\", L\"任务管理器\"},\r\n    {L\"Task view\", L\"任务视图\"},\r\n    {L\"Taskbar back to Windows' default for now\", L\"任务栏暂时恢复为 Windows 默认样式\"},\r\n    {L\"Tasks\", L\"任务\"},\r\n    {L\"Tasks button\", L\"任务按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"Tell me what's new after an update\", L\"更新后告诉我新功能\"},\r\n    {L\"Temperature\", L\"温度\"},\r\n    {L\"Temperature unit\", L\"温度单位\"},\r\n    {L\"Text\", L\"文字\"},\r\n    {L\"Text size\", L\"文字大小\"},\r\n    {L\"The Bar style\", L\"条形样式\"},\r\n    {L\"The app in focus on this monitor (its icon and name)\", L\"此显示器上的焦点应用（图标和名称）\"},\r\n    {L\"The apps heard playing, also players without Windows' media controls; with some on, only they bring it. With none on, any sound does\", L\"检测到正在播放的应用，包括没有 Windows 媒体控件的播放器；开启其中一些后，只有它们会显示可视化。全部关闭时，任何声音都会显示\"},\r\n    {L\"The apps seen playing; a click turns one's lyrics off, and nothing of its songs is sent to lrclib.net\", L\"已检测到播放内容的应用；点击可关闭某个应用的歌词，其歌曲信息将不会发送到 lrclib.net\"},\r\n    {L\"The bar at the top, or upright on the left or the right edge, its items one under the other; windows keep out of its strip\", L\"栏位于顶部，或竖立在左侧或右侧边缘，项目上下排列；窗口不会进入它的区域\"},\r\n    {L\"The bar doesn't minimize\", L\"栏不会最小化\"},\r\n    {L\"The bar's inner corners\", L\"栏的内侧圆角\"},\r\n    {L\"The bar's side\", L\"栏的位置\"},\r\n    {L\"The bars' color; the rainbow gives each bar its own, going around slowly\", L\"条形的颜色；彩虹会让每个条形有自己的颜色，并缓慢变换\"},\r\n    {L\"The battery's charge while a laptop charges\", L\"笔记本充电时的电池电量\"},\r\n    {L\"The bell opens Windows' notification center\", L\"铃铛打开 Windows 通知中心\"},\r\n    {L\"The buttons on the panels\", L\"面板上的按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"The calendar opens as a card: today big at its left, the month beside it, buttons for the alarms, the timer and your agendas, and the day's events\", L\"日历以卡片形式打开：左侧大字显示今天，旁边是月份，并有闹钟、计时器和日程订阅的按钮，以及当天的事件\"},\r\n    {L\"The clock on the pill and in the calendar, in a font of its own\", L\"胶囊上和日历中的时钟使用单独的字体\"},\r\n    {L\"The control center's buttons\", L\"控制中心的按钮\"},\r\n    {L\"The cover's\", L\"封面颜色\"},\r\n    {L\"The day's events and holidays under the month, the next ones and the button to add one. Off, the calendar shows only the clock and the month; reminders and the countdown keep working\", L\"月份下方显示当天的事件和节假日、即将到来的事件以及添加事件的按钮。关闭后，日历只显示时钟和月份；提醒和倒计时仍正常工作\"},\r\n    {L\"The dock is chosen in Windhawk, in this mod's settings: Taskbar (the dock, the Windows taskbar transparent or with only the apps, or unchanged); the island can't change it\", L\"程序坞在 Windhawk 中此模组的设置里选择：任务栏（程序坞、透明或只显示应用的 Windows 任务栏，或保持不变）；灵动岛无法更改它\"},\r\n    {L\"The dock is optional: it takes the taskbar's place, and it's chosen in Windhawk\", L\"程序坞是可选的：它会取代任务栏，需要在 Windhawk 中选择\"},\r\n    {L\"The dock is set up in Windhawk\", L\"程序坞在 Windhawk 中设置\"},\r\n    {L\"The edge zone as wide as the pill\", L\"边缘区域与胶囊同宽\"},\r\n    {L\"The effect shown when the wallpaper changes\", L\"更换壁纸时显示的过渡效果\"},\r\n    {L\"The favorite's drive isn't connected\", L\"收藏文件所在的驱动器未连接\"},\r\n    {L\"The folder with your icons\", L\"存放你图标的文件夹\"},\r\n    {L\"The folder with your wallpapers\", L\"存放壁纸的文件夹\"},\r\n    {L\"The glass gets a sheen, a beveled edge, light along its bottom and a soft shadow around it, and the panels' cards look like glass too (idea by Thiago Silva)\", L\"玻璃获得光泽、斜切边缘、底部的反射光和周围柔和的阴影，面板中的卡片也呈现玻璃质感（创意来自 Thiago Silva）\"},\r\n    {L\"The hotspot isn't available now.\", L\"热点当前不可用。\"},\r\n    {L\"The icons'\", L\"图标的颜色\"},\r\n    {L\"The island follows the mouse between screens.\", L\"灵动岛跟随鼠标在屏幕之间移动。\"},\r\n    {L\"The island handles notifications and their sounds (Windows' stay quiet)\", L\"由灵动岛处理通知和声音（Windows 保持安静）\"},\r\n    {L\"The island is the pill at the top of the screen: the clock, the control center, your notifications and what's playing\", L\"灵动岛是屏幕顶部的胶囊：显示时钟、控制中心、你的通知和正在播放的内容\"},\r\n    {L\"The island shows the notifications and plays their sounds, Windows stays quiet\", L\"由灵动岛显示通知并播放提示音，Windows 自带的保持安静\"},\r\n    {L\"The island takes the color of the app in front\", L\"灵动岛采用最前面应用的颜色\"},\r\n    {L\"The island's\", L\"灵动岛的\"},\r\n    {L\"The island's logs\", L\"灵动岛日志\"},\r\n    {L\"The island's: no banners or sounds from it\", L\"灵动岛的：它不显示横幅也不发出声音\"},\r\n    {L\"The items before the clock in the order stay at one corner and the others at the other, without changing sides as items come and go\", L\"顺序中排在时钟之前的项目固定在一角，其余在另一角，项目增减时不会换边\"},\r\n    {L\"The keys below make the pill let clicks through to what's under it, and again take them back; it stays shown\", L\"下面的按键让点击穿透胶囊到达其下方的内容，再按一次恢复；胶囊保持显示\"},\r\n    {L\"The keys below send the island to its line, and again bring it back\", L\"按下方的按键将灵动岛收为细线，再按一次恢复\"},\r\n    {L\"The komorebi buttons also start and stop masir, so focus follows the mouse\", L\"komorebi 按钮同时启动和停止 masir，使焦点跟随鼠标\"},\r\n    {L\"The komorebi buttons also start and stop whkd, its shortcut helper\", L\"komorebi 按钮同时启动和停止其快捷键工具 whkd\"},\r\n    {L\"The line sung now on the pill (place it in the order above), all of them in its panel. Each song's title and artist are sent to lrclib.net (songs only: not videos, voice messages or the apps turned off below)\", L\"胶囊上显示正在唱的歌词（在上方顺序中调整位置），面板中显示全部歌词。每首歌的歌名和歌手会发送到 lrclib.net（仅限歌曲：不包括视频、语音消息或下方已关闭的应用）\"},\r\n    {L\"The line's color, on the pill and lit in the panel\", L\"歌词行的颜色，用于胶囊和面板中的高亮\"},\r\n    {L\"The list stays open after you click an icon (In the pill style)\", L\"点击图标后列表保持打开（仅限胶囊内样式）\"},\r\n    {L\"The minimize arrow keeps the island open\", L\"最小化箭头让灵动岛保持打开\"},\r\n    {L\"The mod's site\", L\"模组网站\"},\r\n    {L\"The mouse at the edge, anywhere along the pill's width, brings it back, also with the line invisible\", L\"鼠标移到边缘胶囊宽度内的任意位置都能让它返回，线条不可见时也一样\"},\r\n    {L\"The name has 1 to 32 characters (a letter outside English, like an accented one, counts as two or three).\", L\"名称为 1 到 32 个字符（英文以外的字符，如汉字或带重音的字母，算作两到三个）。\"},\r\n    {L\"The next alarm that's on\", L\"下一个已开启的闹钟\"},\r\n    {L\"The one chosen on the map\", L\"在地图上选择的屏幕\"},\r\n    {L\"The password has 8 to 63 letters, numbers or symbols, without accents.\", L\"密码为 8 到 63 个字母、数字或符号，不含重音字符。\"},\r\n    {L\"The password has at least 8 characters.\", L\"密码至少需要 8 个字符。\"},\r\n    {L\"The pill as a loading bar\", L\"胶囊作为进度条\"},\r\n    {L\"The pill can stay, or become a thin line while the mouse is away or while a window is maximized; the mouse on the line brings it back\", L\"胶囊可以一直显示，也可以在鼠标离开或窗口最大化时变成一条细线；鼠标移到细线上即可唤回\"},\r\n    {L\"The pill fills like a loading bar with downloads\", L\"下载时胶囊像进度条一样填充\"},\r\n    {L\"The pill fills with the battery's charge while charging\", L\"充电时胶囊随电量填充\"},\r\n    {L\"The pill shows the song's cover without its title. Hover it to read the title\", L\"胶囊只显示歌曲封面，不显示标题。将鼠标悬停在上面即可看到标题\"},\r\n    {L\"The pill takes clicks again\", L\"胶囊恢复接收点击\"},\r\n    {L\"The pill's and the panels' texts, in a font from your PC (click it again to pick another)\", L\"胶囊和面板的文字使用你电脑上的一种字体（再次点击可换另一种）\"},\r\n    {L\"The pill's other items\", L\"胶囊的其他项目\"},\r\n    {L\"The pill's shape\", L\"胶囊形状\"},\r\n    {L\"The progress apps show on their taskbar button (downloads, copies, installs)\", L\"应用在任务栏按钮上显示的进度（下载、复制、安装）\"},\r\n    {L\"The room between the bars; the item grows with it\", L\"音频条之间的间距；项目会随之变宽\"},\r\n    {L\"The settings' own icons\", L\"设置本身的图标\"},\r\n    {L\"The sky as emoji, with the icon pack chosen in the Icons tab, or with a set of weather pictures downloaded once when chosen (Meteocons in color, Weather Icons in one color)\", L\"以表情符号显示天空，或使用“图标”选项卡中所选的图标包，或使用选中时下载一次的天气图片集（Meteocons 为彩色，Weather Icons 为单色）\"},\r\n    {L\"The small pill with the time touches the screen's edge, straight on that side and as thin as its text, covering less of what's under it. The mouse on it opens the island as usual\", L\"带时间的小胶囊贴住屏幕边缘，该侧为直边，厚度与文字相同，遮挡更少。鼠标移到其上仍会照常打开灵动岛\"},\r\n    {L\"The text's\", L\"文字颜色\"},\r\n    {L\"The title and the text, in the pill and in this list\", L\"标题和正文，显示在胶囊和此列表中\"},\r\n    {L\"The weather panel shows feels like, humidity, wind, UV, rain, pressure and clouds as small cards, like a phone's\", L\"天气面板以小卡片显示体感温度、湿度、风、紫外线、降雨、气压和云量，就像手机上那样\"},\r\n    {L\"The weather service didn't answer\", L\"天气服务没有响应\"},\r\n    {L\"The wheel on what's playing changes the song (not the volume)\", L\"在正在播放上滚动滚轮切换歌曲（而不是音量）\"},\r\n    {L\"Their own\", L\"原有颜色\"},\r\n    {L\"Their sliders talk to the monitor over its cable. Turn off if a monitor flickers or a dock or MST hub resets when the control center opens\", L\"它们的滑块通过线缆与显示器通信。如果打开控制中心时显示器闪烁，或扩展坞或 MST 集线器重置，请关闭此项\"},\r\n    {L\"This PC\", L\"此电脑\"},\r\n    {L\"This assistant sets the main choices in a few steps, and each one changes the island at once; everything else is in the tabs on the left\", L\"这个向导用几步设置主要选项，每个选择都会立刻改变灵动岛；其余设置都在左侧的选项卡中\"},\r\n    {L\"This computer has no battery\", L\"这台电脑没有电池\"},\r\n    {L\"This monitor's profile: changes here apply to every monitor using it\", L\"此显示器的配置：这里的更改适用于使用它的所有显示器\"},\r\n    {L\"Three\", L\"三个\"},\r\n    {L\"Thumbnails of the files\", L\"文件缩略图\"},\r\n    {L\"Thunderstorm\", L\"雷暴\"},\r\n    {L\"Thunderstorm with hail\", L\"雷暴伴有冰雹\"},\r\n    {L\"Tiling\", L\"平铺\"},\r\n    {L\"Time for a break\", L\"该休息了\"},\r\n    {L\"Time format\", L\"时间格式\"},\r\n    {L\"Time until the next\", L\"距离下一个的时间\"},\r\n    {L\"Time's up\", L\"时间到\"},\r\n    {L\"Timer\", L\"计时器\"},\r\n    {L\"Timer on the minimized line\", L\"最小化细线上的计时器\"},\r\n    {L\"Timer, stopwatch and Pomodoro\", L\"计时器、秒表和番茄钟\"},\r\n    {L\"Tips under the icons and buttons (their names, an app's notifications)\", L\"图标和按钮下方的提示（名称、应用的通知）\"},\r\n    {L\"Title\", L\"标题\"},\r\n    {L\"Title width\", L\"标题宽度\"},\r\n    {L\"To talk to me and follow my projects\", L\"和我交流并关注我的项目\"},\r\n    {L\"To use “%s”, change:\", L\"要使用“%s”，请更改：\"},\r\n    {L\"Today\", L\"今天\"},\r\n    {L\"Today's color\", L\"今天的颜色\"},\r\n    {L\"Tomorrow\", L\"明天\"},\r\n    {L\"Too many agendas\", L\"日程订阅过多\"},\r\n    {L\"Top\", L\"顶部\"},\r\n    {L\"Top left\", L\"左上\"},\r\n    {L\"Top right\", L\"右上\"},\r\n    {L\"Topics\", L\"主题\"},\r\n    {L\"Total\", L\"总计\"},\r\n    {L\"Touch keyboard\", L\"触摸键盘\"},\r\n    {L\"Transition\", L\"过渡效果\"},\r\n    {L\"Translucent glass: a lighter tint and livelier colors\", L\"半透明玻璃：更浅的色调和更鲜艳的颜色\"},\r\n    {L\"Tray icons\", L\"托盘图标\"},\r\n    {L\"Turn on Claude Code or Codex in the settings\", L\"请在设置中打开 Claude Code 或 Codex\"},\r\n    {L\"Turned off\", L\"已关闭\"},\r\n    {L\"Turned on\", L\"已开启\"},\r\n    {L\"Turns the island's animations on or off, on every monitor\", L\"开启或关闭灵动岛的动画，对所有显示器生效\"},\r\n    {L\"Type\", L\"类型\"},\r\n    {L\"Type the command line.\", L\"请输入命令行。\"},\r\n    {L\"Type to filter the shortcuts…\", L\"输入以筛选快捷键…\"},\r\n    {L\"Type what it opens.\", L\"请输入要打开的内容。\"},\r\n    {L\"Type your note here…\", L\"在这里输入笔记…\"},\r\n    {L\"USB drive\", L\"U 盘\"},\r\n    {L\"USB drive plugged in\", L\"U 盘已插入\"},\r\n    {L\"USB drives\", L\"U 盘\"},\r\n    {L\"USB drives icon on the pill (open or eject them)\", L\"胶囊上的 U 盘图标（打开或弹出）\"},\r\n    {L\"UV index\", L\"紫外线指数\"},\r\n    {L\"Ultrawide vertical stack\", L\"超宽垂直堆叠\"},\r\n    {L\"Unavailable\", L\"不可用\"},\r\n    {L\"Up to 40 favorite files\", L\"最多 40 个收藏文件\"},\r\n    {L\"Upcoming events\", L\"即将到来的事件\"},\r\n    {L\"Upcoming holidays\", L\"即将到来的节假日\"},\r\n    {L\"Update\", L\"更新\"},\r\n    {L\"Update all\", L\"全部更新\"},\r\n    {L\"Update ticked\", L\"更新勾选项\"},\r\n    {L\"Updated %lld days ago\", L\"%lld 天前更新\"},\r\n    {L\"Updated %lld h ago\", L\"%lld 小时前更新\"},\r\n    {L\"Updated %lld min ago\", L\"%lld 分钟前更新\"},\r\n    {L\"Updated now\", L\"刚刚更新\"},\r\n    {L\"Updates\", L\"更新\"},\r\n    {L\"Updates (winget and Windows Update)\", L\"更新（winget 和 Windows 更新）\"},\r\n    {L\"Upload\", L\"上传\"},\r\n    {L\"Upload peak (1 min)\", L\"上传峰值（1 分钟）\"},\r\n    {L\"Upright on the left and right edges\", L\"在左右边缘竖立显示\"},\r\n    {L\"Usage\", L\"使用率\"},\r\n    {L\"Use my location\", L\"使用我的位置\"},\r\n    {L\"Utilization\", L\"利用率\"},\r\n    {L\"VLC 3 doesn't tell Windows' media controls what it plays, so the island can't see it. With this on, while VLC makes sound, the island reads the song's name from VLC's window title, shows it with VLC's icon, and its buttons press play/pause, previous and next in VLC. No cover or time, and VLC must show the name in its window title (its default)\", L\"VLC 3 不会把正在播放的内容告知 Windows 媒体控件，所以灵动岛看不到它。开启后，VLC 发出声音时，灵动岛会从 VLC 的窗口标题读取歌曲名称，并用 VLC 的图标显示，其按钮会在 VLC 中执行播放/暂停、上一首和下一首。没有封面和时间，且 VLC 必须在窗口标题中显示名称（默认如此）\"},\r\n    {L\"Vertical stack\", L\"垂直堆叠\"},\r\n    {L\"Vertical stack, main on the right\", L\"垂直堆叠（主窗口在右侧）\"},\r\n    {L\"Video memory in use (VRAM)\", L\"显存使用量 (VRAM)\"},\r\n    {L\"Videos\", L\"视频\"},\r\n    {L\"Virtual desktops\", L\"虚拟桌面\"},\r\n    {L\"Virtual desktops (the mouse wheel switches them)\", L\"虚拟桌面（鼠标滚轮切换）\"},\r\n    {L\"Visualizer color\", L\"可视化颜色\"},\r\n    {L\"Visualizer color (own)\", L\"可视化颜色（自定义）\"},\r\n    {L\"Visualizer sensitivity\", L\"可视化灵敏度\"},\r\n    {L\"Volume\", L\"音量\"},\r\n    {L\"Volume mixer\", L\"音量合成器\"},\r\n    {L\"Volume percentage beside its icon\", L\"在音量图标旁显示百分比\"},\r\n    {L\"Wallpaper\", L\"壁纸\"},\r\n    {L\"Wallpaper (the wheel: the next one)\", L\"壁纸（滚轮：下一张）\"},\r\n    {L\"Wallpaper transition\", L\"壁纸过渡效果\"},\r\n    {L\"Wallpapers from a folder (with a transition)\", L\"来自文件夹的壁纸（带过渡效果）\"},\r\n    {L\"Weather\", L\"天气\"},\r\n    {L\"Weather (goes online)\", L\"天气（需联网）\"},\r\n    {L\"Weather Icons\", L\"Weather Icons\"},\r\n    {L\"Weather data by Open-Meteo.com\", L\"天气数据来自 Open-Meteo.com\"},\r\n    {L\"Weather icons\", L\"天气图标\"},\r\n    {L\"Website\", L\"网站\"},\r\n    {L\"Week\", L\"本周\"},\r\n    {L\"Weekday\", L\"星期\"},\r\n    {L\"Weekdays\", L\"工作日\"},\r\n    {L\"Weekends\", L\"周末\"},\r\n    {L\"Welcome to Mac Island & Dock\", L\"欢迎使用 Mac Island & Dock\"},\r\n    {L\"What Claude Code in a terminal gives its status line (a line in its script, see the item's panel). The Claude desktop app doesn't leave its limits on this PC, so it can't show here\", L\"终端中的 Claude Code 传给其状态栏的数据（在其脚本中加一行，见该项目的面板）。Claude 桌面应用不会把额度留在这台电脑上，所以这里无法显示\"},\r\n    {L\"What Codex writes in its logs on this PC\", L\"Codex 在本机日志中写入的数据\"},\r\n    {L\"What it does\", L\"作用\"},\r\n    {L\"What it opens\", L\"打开的内容\"},\r\n    {L\"What needs doing?\", L\"要做什么？\"},\r\n    {L\"What's new\", L\"新功能\"},\r\n    {L\"What's playing\", L\"正在播放\"},\r\n    {L\"What's playing on the minimized line\", L\"最小化细线上的正在播放\"},\r\n    {L\"What's playing's buttons and pictures\", L\"正在播放的按钮和图片\"},\r\n    {L\"When it hides\", L\"何时隐藏\"},\r\n    {L\"Where banners show\", L\"横幅显示位置\"},\r\n    {L\"Where the island appears\", L\"灵动岛显示的位置\"},\r\n    {L\"Where the items go along the bar. Automatic: around the clock when it's in the middle, otherwise at the right end\", L\"项目在条形上的位置。自动：时钟在中间时围绕时钟，否则靠右端\"},\r\n    {L\"While a line is sung, it takes the title and artist's place; between lines they come back\", L\"唱到某一句时，它会代替歌曲名称和艺术家显示；句与句之间它们会回来\"},\r\n    {L\"While a timer, Pomodoro or the stopwatch runs, the line becomes a small pill with its ring and its time (with Only the clock, the time goes beside the clock)\", L\"计时器、番茄钟或秒表运行时，细线会变成一个带圆环和时间的小胶囊（开启“隐藏时只显示时钟”时，时间显示在时钟旁边）\"},\r\n    {L\"While an app's window is maximized on this monitor, the bar goes back to its usual look (frosted, with the frosted glass on), so the window doesn't show behind it\", L\"当应用窗口在此显示器上最大化时，横栏恢复通常外观（开启磨砂玻璃时为磨砂），窗口不会透过它显示\"},\r\n    {L\"While something plays, the line becomes a thin pill with the song's cover and moving bars; the mouse on it opens the island, as on the line (with Only the clock, they go beside the clock)\", L\"播放内容时，细线会变成一个带歌曲封面和跳动条的细胶囊；鼠标移到上面会像细线一样打开灵动岛（开启“隐藏时只显示时钟”时，它们显示在时钟旁边）\"},\r\n    {L\"While the app is in front, the pill moves there and shows only the lit icons.\", L\"当该应用在前台时，胶囊会移到那里并只显示点亮的图标。\"},\r\n    {L\"While the app is in front, the pill moves there and shows only the lit icons. Dragging it then changes its place too.\", L\"当该应用在前台时，胶囊会移到那里并只显示点亮的图标。之后拖动它也会改变它的位置。\"},\r\n    {L\"While the timer runs\", L\"计时器运行时\"},\r\n    {L\"Wi-Fi / network\", L\"Wi-Fi / 网络\"},\r\n    {L\"Wi-Fi is off\", L\"Wi-Fi 已关闭\"},\r\n    {L\"Wi-Fi, sound, battery, the bell and the clock, each step of them. Click an icon to use a picture of your own for it, its brush (top left) for a color of its own; the x goes back to the pack's\", L\"Wi-Fi、声音、电池、铃铛和时钟，以及它们的每个状态。点击图标可为它使用你自己的图片，点击它的画笔（左上角）可为它单独设置颜色；x 恢复为图标包的样子\"},\r\n    {L\"Wide\", L\"宽\"},\r\n    {L\"Widgets\", L\"小组件\"},\r\n    {L\"Width of the edge zone where the mouse brings the pill back\", L\"鼠标移到屏幕边缘该宽度的区域即可唤回胶囊\"},\r\n    {L\"Win+A opens the island's control center\", L\"Win+A 打开灵动岛的控制中心\"},\r\n    {L\"Win+J minimizes the island to its line and brings it back\", L\"Win+J 把灵动岛最小化成一条线，再按一次恢复\"},\r\n    {L\"Win+L stays Windows' (it locks the PC)\", L\"Win+L 归 Windows 所有（用于锁定电脑）\"},\r\n    {L\"Win+N and Win+A can open the island's notifications and control center instead of Windows'\", L\"Win+N 和 Win+A 可以打开灵动岛的通知和控制中心，而不是 Windows 的\"},\r\n    {L\"Win+N opens the island's notifications\", L\"Win+N 打开灵动岛的通知\"},\r\n    {L\"Win+X menu\", L\"Win+X 菜单\"},\r\n    {L\"Wind\", L\"风\"},\r\n    {L\"Window maximized\", L\"窗口最大化\"},\r\n    {L\"Window over it\", L\"窗口覆盖\"},\r\n    {L\"Windows\", L\"Windows\"},\r\n    {L\"Windows 10\", L\"Windows 10\"},\r\n    {L\"Windows 10's, where it has them\", L\"Windows 10 的图标（如果有）\"},\r\n    {L\"Windows 11\", L\"Windows 11\"},\r\n    {L\"Windows Settings\", L\"Windows 设置\"},\r\n    {L\"Windows Update\", L\"Windows 更新\"},\r\n    {L\"Windows accent\", L\"Windows 强调色\"},\r\n    {L\"Windows or another app uses them too, the island takes them first\", L\"Windows 或其他应用也在使用，灵动岛会优先响应\"},\r\n    {L\"Windows places\", L\"Windows 位置\"},\r\n    {L\"Windows shows the networks only to apps allowed to use the location: click to turn on \\\"Let desktop apps access your location\\\"\", L\"Windows 只向可以使用位置的应用显示网络：点击开启\\u201c允许桌面应用访问你的位置\\u201d\"},\r\n    {L\"Windows stopped while a monitor answered a brightness call (DDC/CI). To turn it on again: island settings > Control center > Brightness of external monitors (DDC/CI).\", L\"显示器响应亮度请求（DDC/CI）时 Windows 停止运行。要重新开启：灵动岛设置 > 控制中心 > 外接显示器的亮度 (DDC/CI)。\"},\r\n    {L\"Windows'\", L\"Windows 的\"},\r\n    {L\"Windows' own icons\", L\"Windows 自带的图标\"},\r\n    {L\"Windows' own: no notification sounds\", L\"Windows 自己的：没有通知声音\"},\r\n    {L\"Windows, Windows 10 and Emoji are Windows' own fonts. The online ones (all free to use: MIT, Apache 2.0 or ISC) go online once, when chosen: about 150 small SVG pictures are downloaded from cdn.jsdelivr.net (a plain request for each file, nothing about you or your PC is sent), kept in the mod's folder, and never downloaded again. An icon a pack hasn't stays Windows'. Your folder: a picture (PNG, SVG, ICO...) per icon, named after it\", L\"Windows、Windows 10 和 Emoji 是 Windows 自带的字体。在线图标包（均可免费使用：MIT、Apache 2.0 或 ISC）只在选择时联网一次：从 cdn.jsdelivr.net 下载约 150 个小型 SVG 图片（每个文件只发一个普通请求，不会发送关于你或你电脑的任何信息），保存在模组的文件夹中，之后不会再次下载。图标包里没有的图标保持 Windows 的样子。你的文件夹：每个图标一张图片（PNG、SVG、ICO...），以图标名称命名\"},\r\n    {L\"With a click\", L\"点击\"},\r\n    {L\"With a click, the line only grows under the mouse and opens when clicked (the hidden Bar's clock too)\", L\"选择点击时，鼠标移到细线上只会让它变粗，点击才会打开（隐藏的栏的时钟也一样）\"},\r\n    {L\"With its window's title\", L\"显示窗口标题\"},\r\n    {L\"With names\", L\"带名称\"},\r\n    {L\"With the Bar style\", L\"使用栏样式时\"},\r\n    {L\"With the Fixed style\", L\"使用固定样式时\"},\r\n    {L\"With the Island style\", L\"使用岛屿样式时\"},\r\n    {L\"With the island hidden, only this notch's line shows and opens it\", L\"灵动岛隐藏时，只显示这个刘海的线条，也只有它能打开灵动岛\"},\r\n    {L\"With the line on, a click on the arrow keeps this monitor's island open until you click it again\", L\"开启线条时，点击箭头会让此显示器的灵动岛保持打开，再次点击取消\"},\r\n    {L\"With the mouse\", L\"鼠标移到上面\"},\r\n    {L\"Without Git Bash, Claude Code runs its status line in PowerShell: copy the line into its script, after it reads its input into $stdin (see the README)\", L\"没有 Git Bash 时，Claude Code 用 PowerShell 运行状态栏：把这一行复制到状态栏脚本中，放在脚本把输入读入 $stdin 之后（见 README）\"},\r\n    {L\"Working…\", L\"正在执行…\"},\r\n    {L\"Workspace\", L\"工作区\"},\r\n    {L\"World clocks\", L\"世界时钟\"},\r\n    {L\"World clocks (Windows' additional clocks)\", L\"世界时钟（Windows 的附加时钟）\"},\r\n    {L\"World clocks inside the clock\", L\"世界时钟放进时钟里\"},\r\n    {L\"Write\", L\"输入\"},\r\n    {L\"Writes the charge level as a number next to its icon\", L\"在电池图标旁用数字显示电量\"},\r\n    {L\"Writes the month as a number, like 9/10, not as a name\", L\"月份显示为数字（如 9/10），而不是名称\"},\r\n    {L\"Writes the volume level as a number next to its icon\", L\"在音量图标旁用数字显示音量大小\"},\r\n    {L\"Y M D\", L\"年 月 日\"},\r\n    {L\"Year\", L\"年份\"},\r\n    {L\"Yes, change\", L\"是，更改\"},\r\n    {L\"Your city (like Campinas)\", L\"你的城市（如 北京）\"},\r\n    {L\"Your commands\", L\"你的命令\"},\r\n    {L\"Your events and your agendas' events\", L\"你的事件和日程中的事件\"},\r\n    {L\"Your folder (none chosen yet)\", L\"你的文件夹（尚未选择）\"},\r\n    {L\"Your folder…\", L\"你的文件夹…\"},\r\n    {L\"Your location wasn't found yet, trying again\", L\"尚未找到你的位置，正在重试\"},\r\n    {L\"Your own colors\", L\"自定义颜色\"},\r\n    {L\"Z to A\", L\"Z 到 A\"},\r\n    {L\"Zoom\", L\"缩放\"},\r\n    {L\"checking\", L\"正在检查\"},\r\n    {L\"en\", L\"zh\"},\r\n    {L\"from Windhawk\", L\"来自 Windhawk\"},\r\n    {L\"hours\", L\"小时\"},\r\n    {L\"icons saved\", L\"个图标已保存\"},\r\n    {L\"in %d h\", L\"%d 小时后\"},\r\n    {L\"in %d h %d min\", L\"%d 小时 %d 分钟后\"},\r\n    {L\"in %d min\", L\"%d 分钟后\"},\r\n    {L\"installed\", L\"已安装\"},\r\n    {L\"komorebi\", L\"komorebi\"},\r\n    {L\"komorebi (start, stop, reload)\", L\"komorebi（启动、停止、重新加载）\"},\r\n    {L\"komorebi isn't installed\", L\"未安装 komorebi\"},\r\n    {L\"komorebi's layout\", L\"komorebi 布局\"},\r\n    {L\"komorebi: hide the workspaces without windows\", L\"komorebi：隐藏没有窗口的工作区\"},\r\n    {L\"komorebi: its layout on the pill (a menu changes it)\", L\"komorebi：胶囊上的布局（用菜单切换）\"},\r\n    {L\"komorebi: with masir (focus follows the mouse)\", L\"komorebi：同时运行 masir（焦点跟随鼠标）\"},\r\n    {L\"komorebi: with whkd (its shortcuts)\", L\"komorebi：同时运行 whkd（它的快捷键）\"},\r\n    {L\"min\", L\"分\"},\r\n    {L\"more\", L\"更多\"},\r\n    {L\"not connected\", L\"未连接\"},\r\n    {L\"notification\", L\"条通知\"},\r\n    {L\"notifications\", L\"条通知\"},\r\n    {L\"now\", L\"刚刚\"},\r\n    {L\"off\", L\"关\"},\r\n    {L\"on\", L\"开\"},\r\n    {L\"sec\", L\"秒\"},\r\n    {L\"starting now\", L\"现在开始\"},\r\n    {L\"tab\", L\"选项卡\"},\r\n    {L\"taken by another command\", L\"已被另一个命令使用\"},\r\n    {L\"taken by another of the island's shortcuts\", L\"已被灵动岛的其他快捷键使用\"},\r\n    {L\"taken by one of your commands\", L\"已被你的某个命令使用\"},\r\n    {L\"taken by the island's Win+N or Win+A\", L\"已被灵动岛的 Win+N 或 Win+A 使用\"},\r\n    {L\"this\", L\"此项\"},\r\n    {L\"use Win, Ctrl or Alt with a key\", L\"请将 Win、Ctrl 或 Alt 与一个键组合\"},\r\n    {L\"week\", L\"本周\"},\r\n    {L\"what to change\", L\"需要更改的内容\"},\r\n    {L\"winget couldn't list them\", L\"winget 无法列出更新\"},\r\n    {L\"winget isn't installed\", L\"未安装 winget\"},\r\n    {L\"yesterday\", L\"昨天\"},\r\n    {L\"“Restore what changed” on this option undoes it later\", L\"之后可以用这个选项上的“恢复所做的更改”撤销\"},\r\n    {L\"…and then what else it says it needs\", L\"……然后是它提示还需要的其他内容\"},\r\n    {L\"✓ All of them are there\", L\"✓ 已全部在那里\"},\r\n    {L\"✓ Copied\", L\"✓ 已复制\"},\r\n    {L\"\\u2713 Emptied\", L\"✓ 已清空\"},\r\n    {L\"\\u2713 Exported\", L\"✓ 已导出\"},\r\n    {L\"✓ Saved\", L\"✓ 已保存\"},\r\n};\r\n// clang-format on\r\n\r\n// The island's texts in German, by their English ones (see Tr). Sorted by\r\n// the English text.\r\n// clang-format off\r\nconstexpr std::pair<PCWSTR, PCWSTR> kGermanTexts[] = {\r\n    {L\" (all apps)\", L\" (alle Apps)\"},\r\n    {L\" (all monitors)\", L\" (alle Monitore)\"},\r\n    {L\" by caliberda\", L\" von caliberda\"},\r\n    {L\" events\", L\" Termine\"},\r\n    {L\" files\", L\" Dateien\"},\r\n    {L\" in progress\", L\" in Arbeit\"},\r\n    {L\" shortcuts imported\", L\" Tastenkombinationen importiert\"},\r\n    {L\" · HDR: SDR content\", L\" · HDR: SDR-Inhalte\"},\r\n    {L\" · almost full\", L\" · fast voll\"},\r\n    {L\" · click to hide\", L\" · Klicken zum Ausblenden\"},\r\n    {L\" · drag to move\", L\" · Ziehen zum Verschieben\"},\r\n    {L\" · hidden, click to show\", L\" · ausgeblendet, Klicken zum Anzeigen\"},\r\n    {L\" · main island\", L\" · Hauptinsel\"},\r\n    {L\" · no sound\", L\" · kein Ton\"},\r\n    {L\" · on the island, Ctrl+drag works too\", L\" · auf der Insel geht auch Strg+Ziehen\"},\r\n    {L\" · plain color while Windows' energy saver is on\", L\" · einfarbig, solange der Energiesparmodus von Windows aktiv ist\"},\r\n    {L\" · plain color: Windows' transparency effects are off (Personalization > Colors)\", L\" · einfarbig: Transparenzeffekte von Windows sind aus (Personalisierung > Farben)\"},\r\n    {L\" · press the new keys (Esc cancels)\", L\" · neue Tasten drücken (Esc bricht ab)\"},\r\n    {L\" · this island\", L\" · diese Insel\"},\r\n    {L\" · whkd isn't installed (winget install LGUG2Z.whkd)\", L\" · whkd ist nicht installiert (winget install LGUG2Z.whkd)\"},\r\n    {L\"\\\"Following the bell\\\": out of the pill, as now; or at a point of the screen, sliding in from its nearest edge\", L\"„Der Glocke folgend“: aus der Kapsel heraus, wie bisher; oder an einer Stelle des Bildschirms, vom nächsten Rand hereingleitend\"},\r\n    {L\"\\\"Follows the line\\\": as wide as each line; the others keep the widest line's width. A longer line ends with \\u2026\", L\"„Folgt der Zeile“: so breit wie die jeweilige Zeile; die anderen behalten die breiteste Zeile bei. Längere Zeilen enden mit …\"},\r\n    {L\"%d items\", L\"%d Elemente\"},\r\n    {L\"%d of %d\", L\"%d von %d\"},\r\n    {L\"%zu of %zu events\", L\"%zu von %zu Terminen\"},\r\n    {L\"(the wheel turns the pages)\", L\"(Mausrad blättert die Seiten)\"},\r\n    {L\"+  New event\", L\"+  Neuer Termin\"},\r\n    {L\"+  New shortcut\", L\"+  Neue Verknüpfung\"},\r\n    {L\"+ Add alarm\", L\"+ Wecker hinzufügen\"},\r\n    {L\"+ Line\", L\"+ Linie\"},\r\n    {L\"+ saves the current settings as a profile, to switch back to them later.\", L\"+ speichert die aktuellen Einstellungen als Profil, um später dorthin zurückzuwechseln.\"},\r\n    {L\".ics link or file path\", L\".ics-Link oder Dateipfad\"},\r\n    {L\"1 day\", L\"1 Tag\"},\r\n    {L\"1 item\", L\"1 Element\"},\r\n    {L\"10 min\", L\"10 Min.\"},\r\n    {L\"12 h AM/PM\", L\"12 Std. AM/PM\"},\r\n    {L\"2 min\", L\"2 Min.\"},\r\n    {L\"24 h\", L\"24 Std.\"},\r\n    {L\"30 days\", L\"30 Tage\"},\r\n    {L\"30 s\", L\"30 s\"},\r\n    {L\"5-hour session\", L\"5-Stunden-Sitzung\"},\r\n    {L\"7 days\", L\"7 Tage\"},\r\n    {L\"A Windows update came before Microsoft published the files Windhawk needs to change the taskbar (taskbar.dll %s). Until they're out, the dock and the taskbar's look stay off and the island keeps working. They come back by themselves at the next sign-in after that.\", L\"Ein Windows-Update kam, bevor Microsoft die Dateien veröffentlicht hat, die Windhawk zum Ändern der Taskleiste braucht (taskbar.dll %s). Bis dahin bleiben das Dock und das Aussehen der Taskleiste aus, und die Insel funktioniert weiter. Danach kommen sie bei der nächsten Anmeldung von selbst zurück.\"},\r\n    {L\"A browser's download standing still shows paused\", L\"Stehender Browser-Download erscheint pausiert\"},\r\n    {L\"A bubble on the island says when Caps Lock is turned on or off\", L\"Eine Blase auf der Insel zeigt, wann die Feststelltaste ein- oder ausgeschaltet wird\"},\r\n    {L\"A click on an item opens it; when you don't use it, the pill can shrink into a thin line\", L\"Ein Klick auf ein Element öffnet es; wenn du sie nicht benutzt, kann die Kapsel zu einer dünnen Linie schrumpfen\"},\r\n    {L\"A click on the bell opens Windows' own notification center instead of the island's list\", L\"Ein Klick auf die Glocke öffnet das Benachrichtigungscenter von Windows statt der Liste der Insel\"},\r\n    {L\"A file with all of it (agenda links too)\", L\"Eine Datei mit allem (auch die Kalender-Links)\"},\r\n    {L\"A grid on the pill that opens all your apps, Store apps too, like macOS: search them by typing, your favorites first (the star), then all of them in alphabetical order\", L\"Ein Raster in der Kapsel, das alle deine Apps öffnet, auch Store-Apps, wie unter macOS: Tippe, um sie zu suchen, zuerst deine Favoriten (der Stern), dann alle in alphabetischer Reihenfolge\"},\r\n    {L\"A line while a window is maximized\", L\"Eine Linie, solange ein Fenster maximiert ist\"},\r\n    {L\"A line with the mouse away\", L\"Eine Linie, wenn die Maus weg ist\"},\r\n    {L\"A long title keeps scrolling while it plays\", L\"Ein langer Titel scrollt während der Wiedergabe\"},\r\n    {L\"A notch with no items disappears, the one with the bell too. It comes back when an item or a notification comes to it, and while you drag items between the notches here. The strip kept on the screen stays the same\", L\"Eine Aussparung ohne Elemente verschwindet, auch die mit der Glocke. Sie kommt zurück, wenn ein Element oder eine Benachrichtigung eintrifft und während du hier Elemente zwischen den Aussparungen ziehst. Der reservierte Streifen auf dem Bildschirm bleibt gleich\"},\r\n    {L\"A notification's text stays on one line, and under the mouse it scrolls to its end and back instead of opening on up to three lines. With animations reduced or off, it opens on three lines as usual\", L\"Der Text einer Benachrichtigung bleibt einzeilig und läuft unter der Maus bis zum Ende und zurück, statt sich auf bis zu drei Zeilen zu öffnen. Mit reduzierten oder ausgeschalteten Animationen öffnet er sich wie gewohnt auf drei Zeilen\"},\r\n    {L\"A picture for this icon\", L\"Ein Bild für dieses Symbol\"},\r\n    {L\"A right click on the island shows a gear: it opens these settings\", L\"Ein Rechtsklick auf die Insel zeigt ein Zahnrad: Es öffnet diese Einstellungen\"},\r\n    {L\"A ring along the edge shows the charge: green above 40%, yellow down to 20%, red below. Not as the line, nor on the Bar style\", L\"Ein Ring am Rand zeigt den Akkustand: grün über 40 %, gelb bis 20 %, rot darunter. Nicht als Linie und nicht im Balken-Stil\"},\r\n    {L\"A summary of the PC, the island's settings and its last 300 log lines (the dock's are in Windhawk's log)\", L\"Eine Übersicht zum PC, die Einstellungen der Insel und die letzten 300 Protokollzeilen (das Protokoll des Docks steht im Windhawk-Protokoll)\"},\r\n    {L\"A title too long to fit scrolls across while it plays\", L\"Ein zu langer Titel scrollt während der Wiedergabe durch\"},\r\n    {L\"A to Z\", L\"A bis Z\"},\r\n    {L\"AI usage\", L\"KI-Nutzung\"},\r\n    {L\"About\", L\"Info\"},\r\n    {L\"Accent\", L\"Akzent\"},\r\n    {L\"Accent color\", L\"Akzentfarbe\"},\r\n    {L\"Accessibility\", L\"Barrierefreiheit\"},\r\n    {L\"Add\", L\"Hinzufügen\"},\r\n    {L\"Add  (Enter)\", L\"Hinzufügen  (Enter)\"},\r\n    {L\"Add a folder\", L\"Ordner hinzufügen\"},\r\n    {L\"Add a separator line · drag it between icons, click it to remove\", L\"Trennlinie hinzufügen · zwischen die Symbole ziehen, zum Entfernen anklicken\"},\r\n    {L\"Add an open app\", L\"Geöffnete App hinzufügen\"},\r\n    {L\"Add clocks in Windows' date and time settings (Additional clocks)\", L\"Uhren in den Datums- und Uhrzeiteinstellungen von Windows hinzufügen (Zusätzliche Uhren)\"},\r\n    {L\"Add controls\", L\"Steuerelemente hinzufügen\"},\r\n    {L\"Add note  (Ctrl+Enter)\", L\"Notiz hinzufügen  (Strg+Enter)\"},\r\n    {L\"Add the shortcuts you want to remember\", L\"Fügen Sie die Tastenkombinationen hinzu, die Sie sich merken wollen\"},\r\n    {L\"Added to your commands\", L\"Zu deinen Befehlen hinzugefügt\"},\r\n    {L\"Adds a button for sleep, restart and shut down\", L\"Fügt eine Schaltfläche für Energie sparen, Neustart und Herunterfahren hinzu\"},\r\n    {L\"Adds a button that lists the keyboard shortcuts\", L\"Fügt eine Schaltfläche hinzu, die die Tastenkombinationen auflistet\"},\r\n    {L\"Adds a button that mutes and unmutes the microphone\", L\"Fügt eine Schaltfläche zum Stummschalten des Mikrofons hinzu\"},\r\n    {L\"Adds a button that opens your quick notes\", L\"Fügt eine Schaltfläche hinzu, die Ihre Kurznotizen öffnet\"},\r\n    {L\"Adds a button that opens your to-do list\", L\"Fügt eine Schaltfläche hinzu, die Ihre Aufgabenliste öffnet\"},\r\n    {L\"Adds a button that switches Windows between light and dark\", L\"Fügt eine Schaltfläche zum Wechseln zwischen hellem und dunklem Windows-Modus hinzu\"},\r\n    {L\"Adds a button to switch profiles from the pill\", L\"Fügt eine Schaltfläche zum Profilwechsel in der Kapsel hinzu\"},\r\n    {L\"Adds a small arrow at the pill's end that hides it to its line\", L\"Fügt am Ende der Kapsel einen kleinen Pfeil hinzu, der sie zur Linie einklappt\"},\r\n    {L\"Adds a timer, a stopwatch and a Pomodoro to the pill\", L\"Fügt der Kapsel einen Timer, eine Stoppuhr und einen Pomodoro hinzu\"},\r\n    {L\"Adds a way to reach the tray icons of other apps from the pill\", L\"Fügt der Kapsel einen Zugang zu den Infobereich-Symbolen anderer Apps hinzu\"},\r\n    {L\"Adds the Recycle Bin to the pill\", L\"Fügt den Papierkorb der Kapsel hinzu\"},\r\n    {L\"Adds the day and the month to the clock\", L\"Fügt der Uhr Tag und Monat hinzu\"},\r\n    {L\"Adds the notifications bell to the pill\", L\"Fügt der Kapsel die Benachrichtigungsglocke hinzu\"},\r\n    {L\"Adds the seconds to the time\", L\"Fügt der Uhrzeit die Sekunden hinzu\"},\r\n    {L\"Adds the weekday to the clock\", L\"Fügt der Uhr den Wochentag hinzu\"},\r\n    {L\"Adds the year to the clock\", L\"Fügt der Uhr das Jahr hinzu\"},\r\n    {L\"After its app: stays\", L\"Nach seiner App: bleibt\"},\r\n    {L\"After its app: the one before\", L\"Nach seiner App: der vorherige\"},\r\n    {L\"Again to put every setting back to its default (notes, tasks, events and profiles stay)\", L\"Noch einmal, um alle Einstellungen auf Standard zu setzen (Notizen, Aufgaben, Termine und Profile bleiben)\"},\r\n    {L\"Agendas\", L\"Kalender\"},\r\n    {L\"Airplane mode\", L\"Flugzeugmodus\"},\r\n    {L\"Alarm\", L\"Wecker\"},\r\n    {L\"Alarms\", L\"Wecker\"},\r\n    {L\"All\", L\"Alle\"},\r\n    {L\"All apps\", L\"Alle Apps\"},\r\n    {L\"All day\", L\"Ganztägig\"},\r\n    {L\"All done\", L\"Alles erledigt\"},\r\n    {L\"All files\", L\"Alle Dateien\"},\r\n    {L\"All set\", L\"Alles bereit\"},\r\n    {L\"All up to date\", L\"Alles aktuell\"},\r\n    {L\"Already added\", L\"Bereits hinzugefügt\"},\r\n    {L\"Also shows the title of the window in focus, like the page or the file open in it\", L\"Zeigt auch den Titel des Fensters im Fokus, etwa die darin geöffnete Seite oder Datei\"},\r\n    {L\"Always\", L\"Immer\"},\r\n    {L\"Always on the pill, even with nothing playing\", L\"Immer in der Kapsel, auch wenn nichts läuft\"},\r\n    {L\"Always shown\", L\"Immer sichtbar\"},\r\n    {L\"Always, or only once what's in it weighs this much (it comes and goes by itself)\", L\"Immer, oder erst wenn der Inhalt so viel wiegt (er erscheint und verschwindet von selbst)\"},\r\n    {L\"An app appears here once it plays something\", L\"Eine App erscheint hier, sobald sie etwas abspielt\"},\r\n    {L\"Animations\", L\"Animationen\"},\r\n    {L\"App\", L\"App\"},\r\n    {L\"App in focus\", L\"App im Fokus\"},\r\n    {L\"Applies to every monitor, and the island restarts to apply it\", L\"Gilt für jeden Monitor, die Insel startet zum Übernehmen neu\"},\r\n    {L\"Apply\", L\"Übernehmen\"},\r\n    {L\"Apps\", L\"Apps\"},\r\n    {L\"Apps (launcher)\", L\"Apps (Starter)\"},\r\n    {L\"Apps (winget, in a terminal)\", L\"Apps (winget, im Terminal)\"},\r\n    {L\"Apps and tools\", L\"Apps und Tools\"},\r\n    {L\"Apps that bring the visualizer\", L\"Apps, die den Visualizer zeigen\"},\r\n    {L\"Apps that look for lyrics\", L\"Apps, die Songtexte suchen\"},\r\n    {L\"Apps with notifications\", L\"Apps mit Benachrichtigungen\"},\r\n    {L\"Apps with unsaved work can stop it.\", L\"Apps mit nicht gespeicherter Arbeit können es verhindern.\"},\r\n    {L\"Area that brings it back\", L\"Bereich zum Zurückholen\"},\r\n    {L\"Arguments (if any)\", L\"Argumente (falls nötig)\"},\r\n    {L\"Arguments (optional)\", L\"Argumente (optional)\"},\r\n    {L\"Ask before restarting, shutting down or signing out\", L\"Vor Neustart, Herunterfahren oder Abmelden fragen\"},\r\n    {L\"Ask every time\", L\"Jedes Mal fragen\"},\r\n    {L\"Ask the first time\", L\"Beim ersten Mal fragen\"},\r\n    {L\"Audio visualizer\", L\"Audio-Visualizer\"},\r\n    {L\"Audio visualizer (bars moving with the sound)\", L\"Audio-Visualizer (Balken bewegen sich zum Ton)\"},\r\n    {L\"Auto\", L\"Auto\"},\r\n    {L\"Auto (light or dark)\", L\"Auto (hell oder dunkel)\"},\r\n    {L\"Auto, inverted (the other way from Windows)\", L\"Auto, invertiert (umgekehrt zu Windows)\"},\r\n    {L\"Automatic\", L\"Automatisch\"},\r\n    {L\"Available\", L\"Verfügbar\"},\r\n    {L\"BSP\", L\"BSP\"},\r\n    {L\"Back\", L\"Zurück\"},\r\n    {L\"Back to default\", L\"Auf Standard zurücksetzen\"},\r\n    {L\"Back to focus\", L\"Zurück zum Fokus\"},\r\n    {L\"Backup\", L\"Sicherung\"},\r\n    {L\"Backup (notes, tasks, profiles and settings)\", L\"Sicherung (Notizen, Aufgaben, Profile und Einstellungen)\"},\r\n    {L\"Balanced\", L\"Ausgewogen\"},\r\n    {L\"Banner corners\", L\"Bannerecken\"},\r\n    {L\"Banner size\", L\"Bannergröße\"},\r\n    {L\"Banner width\", L\"Bannerbreite\"},\r\n    {L\"Banners\", L\"Banner\"},\r\n    {L\"Banners (notifications on the pill)\", L\"Banner (Mitteilungen in der Kapsel)\"},\r\n    {L\"Banners even with the pill minimized\", L\"Banner auch bei minimierter Kapsel\"},\r\n    {L\"Banners in the pill\", L\"Banner in der Kapsel\"},\r\n    {L\"Banners show each new notification coming out of the pill\", L\"Banner zeigen jede neue Benachrichtigung, die aus der Kapsel herauskommt\"},\r\n    {L\"Banners still appear while the pill is minimized to its line\", L\"Banner erscheinen auch, wenn die Kapsel zur Linie minimiert ist\"},\r\n    {L\"Bar\", L\"Leiste\"},\r\n    {L\"Bar: along the whole top edge, like macOS' menu bar\", L\"Leiste: über den ganzen oberen Rand, wie die Menüleiste von macOS\"},\r\n    {L\"Bar: items at the screen's corners (the clock in the middle)\", L\"Leiste: Elemente an den Bildschirmecken (Uhr in der Mitte)\"},\r\n    {L\"Bar: items keep their side of the clock\", L\"Leiste: Elemente bleiben auf ihrer Seite der Uhr\"},\r\n    {L\"Bars' height\", L\"Höhe der Balken\"},\r\n    {L\"Bars' width\", L\"Breite der Balken\"},\r\n    {L\"Base frequency\", L\"Grundfrequenz\"},\r\n    {L\"Battery\", L\"Akku\"},\r\n    {L\"Battery charging\", L\"Akku wird geladen\"},\r\n    {L\"Battery charging (own color)\", L\"Akku wird geladen (eigene Farbe)\"},\r\n    {L\"Battery percentage beside its icon\", L\"Akkuprozent neben dem Symbol\"},\r\n    {L\"Black\", L\"Schwarz\"},\r\n    {L\"Blue\", L\"Blau\"},\r\n    {L\"Bluetooth\", L\"Bluetooth\"},\r\n    {L\"Bluetooth & devices\", L\"Bluetooth & Geräte\"},\r\n    {L\"Bluetooth audio connected\", L\"Bluetooth-Audio verbunden\"},\r\n    {L\"Bluetooth is off\", L\"Bluetooth ist aus\"},\r\n    {L\"Bootstrap (online)\", L\"Bootstrap (online)\"},\r\n    {L\"Bottom\", L\"Unten\"},\r\n    {L\"Bottom left\", L\"Unten links\"},\r\n    {L\"Bottom right\", L\"Unten rechts\"},\r\n    {L\"Break\", L\"Pause\"},\r\n    {L\"Brightness\", L\"Helligkeit\"},\r\n    {L\"Brightness of external monitors (DDC/CI)\", L\"Helligkeit externer Monitore (DDC/CI)\"},\r\n    {L\"Brightness of external monitors turned off\", L\"Helligkeit externer Monitore ausgeschaltet\"},\r\n    {L\"Brings the visualizer\", L\"Zeigt den Visualizer\"},\r\n    {L\"Browsers never tell the taskbar a download is paused or failed: one whose bar stands still for 30 s turns yellow\", L\"Browser melden der Taskleiste nie, dass ein Download pausiert oder fehlgeschlagen ist: einer, dessen Balken 30 s stillsteht, wird gelb\"},\r\n    {L\"Bugs and ideas\", L\"Fehler und Ideen\"},\r\n    {L\"Built-in display\", L\"Integrierte Anzeige\"},\r\n    {L\"Button on the island (its icon on the pill)\", L\"Knopf auf der Insel (sein Symbol in der Kapsel)\"},\r\n    {L\"Buttons on the pill\", L\"Schaltflächen in der Kapsel\"},\r\n    {L\"By date modified\", L\"Nach Änderungsdatum\"},\r\n    {L\"By name\", L\"Nach Name\"},\r\n    {L\"By size\", L\"Nach Größe\"},\r\n    {L\"By type\", L\"Nach Typ\"},\r\n    {L\"CPU, RAM and VRAM use\", L\"CPU-, RAM- und VRAM-Auslastung\"},\r\n    {L\"Cached\", L\"Zwischengespeichert\"},\r\n    {L\"Calculator\", L\"Rechner\"},\r\n    {L\"Calendar\", L\"Kalender\"},\r\n    {L\"Calendar full: delete past events in the gear\", L\"Kalender voll: vergangene Termine im Zahnrad löschen\"},\r\n    {L\"Calendar with today big\", L\"Kalender mit großem Heute\"},\r\n    {L\"Calls and alarms silent in Do not disturb\", L\"Anrufe und Wecker im „Nicht stören“ stumm\"},\r\n    {L\"Camera\", L\"Kamera\"},\r\n    {L\"Cancel\", L\"Abbrechen\"},\r\n    {L\"Caps Lock bubble\", L\"Feststelltaste-Hinweis\"},\r\n    {L\"Caps Lock off\", L\"Feststelltaste aus\"},\r\n    {L\"Caps Lock on\", L\"Feststelltaste an\"},\r\n    {L\"Captions\", L\"Live-Untertitel\"},\r\n    {L\"Cast\", L\"Streamen\"},\r\n    {L\"Center\", L\"Mitte\"},\r\n    {L\"Change the order with Ctrl + drag on the island\", L\"Reihenfolge mit Strg + Ziehen auf der Insel ändern\"},\r\n    {L\"Changes are saved in the one in use · the pencil renames, saves or deletes\", L\"Änderungen werden im verwendeten Profil gespeichert · der Stift benennt um, speichert oder löscht\"},\r\n    {L\"Charger plugged in\", L\"Ladegerät angesteckt\"},\r\n    {L\"Charging\", L\"Wird geladen\"},\r\n    {L\"Check every\", L\"Prüfen alle\"},\r\n    {L\"Choose\", L\"Auswählen\"},\r\n    {L\"Choose a power plan\", L\"Energiesparplan wählen\"},\r\n    {L\"Choose a program or a file\", L\"Programm oder Datei wählen\"},\r\n    {L\"Choose it…\", L\"Auswählen…\"},\r\n    {L\"Choose the folder with your pictures\", L\"Ordner mit Ihren Bildern wählen\"},\r\n    {L\"Choose...\", L\"Wählen...\"},\r\n    {L\"Chooses how many animations play, on every monitor\", L\"Legt fest, wie viele Animationen laufen, auf jedem Monitor\"},\r\n    {L\"Chooses which monitors show the island, with a map of your screens\", L\"Legt mit einer Bildschirmkarte fest, auf welchen Monitoren die Insel erscheint\"},\r\n    {L\"Choose…\", L\"Auswählen…\"},\r\n    {L\"Circle\", L\"Kreis\"},\r\n    {L\"City not found\", L\"Stadt nicht gefunden\"},\r\n    {L\"Claude Code\", L\"Claude Code\"},\r\n    {L\"Claude Code (terminal)\", L\"Claude Code (Terminal)\"},\r\n    {L\"Claude Code gives its limits to its status line, run in Git Bash: copy the line into its script, after it reads its input with input=$(cat) (see the README)\", L\"Claude Code übergibt seine Limits seiner Statuszeile, die in Git Bash läuft: Kopiere die Zeile in deren Skript, nachdem es seine Eingabe mit input=$(cat) gelesen hat (siehe README)\"},\r\n    {L\"Claude Code tells its limits with a Pro or Max plan, after its first answer in a session\", L\"Claude Code nennt seine Limits mit einem Pro- oder Max-Plan, nach seiner ersten Antwort in einer Sitzung\"},\r\n    {L\"Clear\", L\"Klar\"},\r\n    {L\"Clear all\", L\"Alle löschen\"},\r\n    {L\"Click a screen to choose where the island appears.\", L\"Klicken Sie auf einen Bildschirm, um festzulegen, wo die Insel erscheint.\"},\r\n    {L\"Click a screen to place the main island there (alerts and tray).\", L\"Klicken Sie auf einen Bildschirm, um dort die Hauptinsel zu platzieren (Hinweise und Infobereich).\"},\r\n    {L\"Click and press the keys\", L\"Klicken und Tasten drücken\"},\r\n    {L\"Click to record\", L\"Zum Aufnehmen klicken\"},\r\n    {L\"Clicking a screenshot notice opens the picture in Explorer\", L\"Ein Klick auf eine Screenshot-Meldung öffnet das Bild im Explorer\"},\r\n    {L\"Clicks go through the pill\", L\"Klicks gehen durch die Kapsel\"},\r\n    {L\"Clipboard\", L\"Zwischenablage\"},\r\n    {L\"Clock\", L\"Uhr\"},\r\n    {L\"Clock against the screen's edge\", L\"Uhr am Bildschirmrand\"},\r\n    {L\"Clock and calendar\", L\"Uhr und Kalender\"},\r\n    {L\"Clock and calendar (agendas: the calendar's gear)\", L\"Uhr und Kalender (Kalender-Abos: Zahnrad im Kalender)\"},\r\n    {L\"Clock font\", L\"Schriftart der Uhr\"},\r\n    {L\"Clock in the middle (the other items move around it)\", L\"Uhr in der Mitte (die anderen Elemente ordnen sich darum an)\"},\r\n    {L\"Close it to finish\", L\"Zum Beenden schließen\"},\r\n    {L\"Clouds\", L\"Wolken\"},\r\n    {L\"Codex\", L\"Codex\"},\r\n    {L\"Codex keeps its limits in its logs on this PC: they show after its next answer\", L\"Codex speichert seine Limits in seinen Protokollen auf diesem PC: Sie erscheinen nach seiner nächsten Antwort\"},\r\n    {L\"Color filters\", L\"Farbfilter\"},\r\n    {L\"Color for downloads and other apps\", L\"Farbe für Downloads und andere Apps\"},\r\n    {L\"Color for file copies\", L\"Farbe für Dateikopien\"},\r\n    {L\"Color for the battery charging\", L\"Farbe fürs Laden des Akkus\"},\r\n    {L\"Colors\", L\"Farben\"},\r\n    {L\"Colors following the app in front (its title bar or its icon)\", L\"Farben folgen der App im Vordergrund (Titelleiste oder Symbol)\"},\r\n    {L\"Colors: like Windows (light or dark with it), always light or always dark, or the colors of the app in front\", L\"Farben: wie Windows (hell oder dunkel mit ihm), immer hell oder immer dunkel, oder die Farben der App im Vordergrund\"},\r\n    {L\"Columns\", L\"Spalten\"},\r\n    {L\"Command (cmd, without a window)\", L\"Befehl (cmd, ohne Fenster)\"},\r\n    {L\"Command line\", L\"Befehlszeile\"},\r\n    {L\"Committed\", L\"Zugesagt\"},\r\n    {L\"Compact (cover only)\", L\"Kompakt (nur Cover)\"},\r\n    {L\"Completed\", L\"Abgeschlossen\"},\r\n    {L\"Compressed\", L\"Komprimiert\"},\r\n    {L\"Connect\", L\"Verbinden\"},\r\n    {L\"Connected\", L\"Verbunden\"},\r\n    {L\"Connecting...\", L\"Verbindung wird hergestellt...\"},\r\n    {L\"Content hidden\", L\"Inhalt ausgeblendet\"},\r\n    {L\"Control Panel\", L\"Systemsteuerung\"},\r\n    {L\"Control center\", L\"Kontrollzentrum\"},\r\n    {L\"Control center buttons on the pill\", L\"Kontrollzentrum-Schaltflächen in der Kapsel\"},\r\n    {L\"Copied\", L\"Kopiert\"},\r\n    {L\"Copy\", L\"Kopieren\"},\r\n    {L\"Copy the line\", L\"Zeile kopieren\"},\r\n    {L\"Cores / threads\", L\"Kerne / Threads\"},\r\n    {L\"Corners\", L\"Ecken\"},\r\n    {L\"Couldn't change the hotspot.\", L\"Der Hotspot konnte nicht geändert werden.\"},\r\n    {L\"Couldn't connect.\", L\"Verbindung nicht möglich.\"},\r\n    {L\"Couldn't connect. Check the password.\", L\"Verbindung nicht möglich. Kennwort prüfen.\"},\r\n    {L\"Couldn't download them: click it again to try\", L\"Download fehlgeschlagen: zum erneuten Versuch noch einmal klicken\"},\r\n    {L\"Couldn't empty it\", L\"Leeren nicht möglich\"},\r\n    {L\"Couldn't forget the network.\", L\"Netzwerk konnte nicht entfernt werden.\"},\r\n    {L\"Couldn't reach lrclib.net\", L\"lrclib.net ist nicht erreichbar\"},\r\n    {L\"Couldn't read it\", L\"Lesen nicht möglich\"},\r\n    {L\"Couldn't save in that folder\", L\"In diesem Ordner konnte nicht gespeichert werden\"},\r\n    {L\"Counts down to Pomodoro's next part\", L\"Zählt bis zum nächsten Abschnitt des Pomodoro herunter\"},\r\n    {L\"Counts down to alarms\", L\"Zählt bis zu Weckern herunter\"},\r\n    {L\"Counts down to events\", L\"Zählt bis zu Terminen herunter\"},\r\n    {L\"Counts down to the timer's end\", L\"Zählt bis zum Ende des Timers herunter\"},\r\n    {L\"Cover and title\", L\"Cover und Titel\"},\r\n    {L\"Cover and title on the pill\", L\"Cover und Titel in der Kapsel\"},\r\n    {L\"Current\", L\"Aktuell\"},\r\n    {L\"Custom\", L\"Benutzerdefiniert\"},\r\n    {L\"Customize…\", L\"Anpassen…\"},\r\n    {L\"Cycles through the pictures of a folder as your wallpaper\", L\"Wechselt die Bilder eines Ordners als Hintergrund durch\"},\r\n    {L\"D M Y\", L\"T M J\"},\r\n    {L\"Dark\", L\"Dunkel\"},\r\n    {L\"Dark mode\", L\"Dunkler Modus\"},\r\n    {L\"Date\", L\"Datum\"},\r\n    {L\"Date modified\", L\"Änderungsdatum\"},\r\n    {L\"Date order\", L\"Datumsreihenfolge\"},\r\n    {L\"Day and month\", L\"Tag und Monat\"},\r\n    {L\"Day of the week\", L\"Wochentag\"},\r\n    {L\"Delete\", L\"Löschen\"},\r\n    {L\"Delete %zu past events?\", L\"%zu vergangene Termine löschen?\"},\r\n    {L\"Delete it?\", L\"Löschen?\"},\r\n    {L\"Delete past events\", L\"Vergangene Termine löschen\"},\r\n    {L\"Desktop\", L\"Desktop\"},\r\n    {L\"Details\", L\"Details\"},\r\n    {L\"Details as cards\", L\"Details als Karten\"},\r\n    {L\"Device\", L\"Gerät\"},\r\n    {L\"Device Manager\", L\"Geräte-Manager\"},\r\n    {L\"Devices\", L\"Geräte\"},\r\n    {L\"Disconnect\", L\"Trennen\"},\r\n    {L\"Disconnected\", L\"Getrennt\"},\r\n    {L\"Disconnecting...\", L\"Verbindung wird getrennt...\"},\r\n    {L\"Dismiss\", L\"Schließen\"},\r\n    {L\"Display\", L\"Anzeige\"},\r\n    {L\"Display brightness\", L\"Anzeigehelligkeit\"},\r\n    {L\"Do not disturb\", L\"Nicht stören\"},\r\n    {L\"Do not disturb turned on or off\", L\"Nicht stören ein- oder ausgeschaltet\"},\r\n    {L\"Dock\", L\"Dock\"},\r\n    {L\"Documents\", L\"Dokumente\"},\r\n    {L\"Done\", L\"Fertig\"},\r\n    {L\"Download\", L\"Download\"},\r\n    {L\"Download peak (1 min)\", L\"Download-Spitze (1 Min.)\"},\r\n    {L\"Download pictures from the web (goes online)\", L\"Bilder aus dem Web laden (online)\"},\r\n    {L\"Downloading the icons\", L\"Symbole werden heruntergeladen\"},\r\n    {L\"Downloads\", L\"Downloads\"},\r\n    {L\"Downloads and other apps\", L\"Downloads und andere Apps\"},\r\n    {L\"Downloads and other apps (own color)\", L\"Downloads und andere Apps (eigene Farbe)\"},\r\n    {L\"Downloads, installs and other apps' progress; red for an error, yellow paused\", L\"Fortschritt von Downloads, Installationen und anderen Apps; rot bei Fehler, gelb pausiert\"},\r\n    {L\"Drag an icon to another notch or place\", L\"Ziehe ein Symbol in eine andere Aussparung oder an eine andere Stelle\"},\r\n    {L\"Drag an icon to change the order\", L\"Ziehe ein Symbol, um die Reihenfolge zu ändern\"},\r\n    {L\"Drag from one notch to another · click to hide\", L\"Von einem Notch zum anderen ziehen · Klicken zum Ausblenden\"},\r\n    {L\"Drag the groups to reorder them, the minimize arrow stays last\", L\"Gruppen zum Umsortieren ziehen, der Minimieren-Pfeil bleibt zuletzt\"},\r\n    {L\"Drag the pill to any spot on the screen (not with notches)\", L\"Kapsel an eine beliebige Stelle des Bildschirms ziehen (nicht mit Notches)\"},\r\n    {L\"Drag to change the order or to put one on the pill · middle click, or the pin after a moment on an icon: kept on the pill\", L\"Ziehen zum Umsortieren oder um eines in die Kapsel zu legen · mittlere Maustaste oder die Nadel nach kurzer Zeit auf einem Symbol: bleibt in der Kapsel\"},\r\n    {L\"Drag to change the order · click to hide\", L\"Ziehen zum Umsortieren · Klicken zum Ausblenden\"},\r\n    {L\"Drive\", L\"Laufwerk\"},\r\n    {L\"Drizzle\", L\"Nieselregen\"},\r\n    {L\"Drop files on the pill to keep them here, then drag them into another app\", L\"Dateien auf die Kapsel ziehen, um sie hier abzulegen, dann in eine andere App ziehen\"},\r\n    {L\"Drop files on the pill to keep them there, then drag them out into another app later (their places are kept, not copies)\", L\"Dateien auf die Kapsel ziehen, um sie dort abzulegen, und später in eine andere App ziehen (ihr Ort wird gemerkt, keine Kopien)\"},\r\n    {L\"Duplicate\", L\"Duplizieren\"},\r\n    {L\"Each bar sways on its own, softly, as loud as the sound; off, they jump with the beat\", L\"Jeder Balken schwingt sanft für sich, so laut wie der Ton; aus: sie springen im Takt\"},\r\n    {L\"Each new one opens the pill for a moment\", L\"Jede neue öffnet die Kapsel kurz\"},\r\n    {L\"Each notch hides alone instead of all at once (Fixed only)\", L\"Jedes Notch blendet sich einzeln aus statt alle zusammen (nur Fest)\"},\r\n    {L\"Each screen has its own island\", L\"Jeder Bildschirm hat seine eigene Insel\"},\r\n    {L\"Edge\", L\"Rand\"},\r\n    {L\"Edge around\", L\"Rand ringsum\"},\r\n    {L\"Edge distance\", L\"Randabstand\"},\r\n    {L\"Edit\", L\"Bearbeiten\"},\r\n    {L\"Edit command\", L\"Befehl bearbeiten\"},\r\n    {L\"Edit task\", L\"Aufgabe bearbeiten\"},\r\n    {L\"Efficiency\", L\"Effizienz\"},\r\n    {L\"Eject\", L\"Auswerfen\"},\r\n    {L\"Ejecting…\", L\"Wird ausgeworfen…\"},\r\n    {L\"Emoji\", L\"Emoji\"},\r\n    {L\"Empty\", L\"Leer\"},\r\n    {L\"Empty it? Click again\", L\"Leeren? Erneut klicken\"},\r\n    {L\"Empty the bin\", L\"Papierkorb leeren\"},\r\n    {L\"Emptying…\", L\"Wird geleert…\"},\r\n    {L\"English letters\", L\"Englische Buchstaben\"},\r\n    {L\"Essential\", L\"Das Nötigste\"},\r\n    {L\"Essential: the clock, the battery, the control center, the volume, the notifications' bell and what's playing\", L\"Das Nötigste: die Uhr, der Akku, das Kontrollzentrum, die Lautstärke, die Benachrichtigungsglocke und die Wiedergabe\"},\r\n    {L\"Ethernet\", L\"Ethernet\"},\r\n    {L\"Even when minimized\", L\"Auch minimiert\"},\r\n    {L\"Event\", L\"Termin\"},\r\n    {L\"Events in the calendar\", L\"Termine im Kalender\"},\r\n    {L\"Events, \", L\"Termine, \"},\r\n    {L\"Every day\", L\"Jeden Tag\"},\r\n    {L\"Every option explained step by step, the roadmap and your votes\", L\"Jede Option Schritt für Schritt erklärt, die Roadmap und deine Stimmen\"},\r\n    {L\"Everyday\", L\"Alltag\"},\r\n    {L\"Everyday: also the next event, the weather (goes online), the timer, your folders, the apps with notifications and the song's cover\", L\"Alltag: dazu der nächste Termin, das Wetter (online), der Timer, deine Ordner, die Apps mit Benachrichtigungen und das Cover des Songs\"},\r\n    {L\"Everything\", L\"Alles\"},\r\n    {L\"Everything: most of the items, from notes and tasks to the network's speed\", L\"Alles: die meisten Elemente, von Notizen und Aufgaben bis zur Netzwerkgeschwindigkeit\"},\r\n    {L\"Export\", L\"Exportieren\"},\r\n    {L\"Export the island's backup\", L\"Sicherung der Insel exportieren\"},\r\n    {L\"Extend\", L\"Erweitern\"},\r\n    {L\"Extra wide\", L\"Extra breit\"},\r\n    {L\"Fade\", L\"Überblenden\"},\r\n    {L\"Fade the line after\", L\"Linie ausblenden nach\"},\r\n    {L\"Fan\", L\"Lüfter\"},\r\n    {L\"Favorite moved or deleted\", L\"Favorit verschoben oder gelöscht\"},\r\n    {L\"Favorites\", L\"Favoriten\"},\r\n    {L\"Favorites are full\", L\"Favoriten sind voll\"},\r\n    {L\"Feels like\", L\"Gefühlt\"},\r\n    {L\"Fetches pictures for banners from the web, it needs an internet connection\", L\"Lädt Bilder für Banner aus dem Web, Internetverbindung nötig\"},\r\n    {L\"File Explorer\", L\"Datei-Explorer\"},\r\n    {L\"File copies\", L\"Dateikopien\"},\r\n    {L\"File copies (own color)\", L\"Dateikopien (eigene Farbe)\"},\r\n    {L\"Files\", L\"Dateien\"},\r\n    {L\"Files copied or moved by Windows (its copy window)\", L\"Von Windows kopierte oder verschobene Dateien (sein Kopierfenster)\"},\r\n    {L\"Files dragged out\", L\"Herausgezogene Dateien\"},\r\n    {L\"Files dragged out of the folders panel or the shelf into an app: copied or moved, or asked (the first time, remembered, or every time)\", L\"Dateien, die aus dem Ordnerbereich oder der Ablage in eine App gezogen werden: kopiert oder verschoben, oder nachgefragt (beim ersten Mal und gemerkt, oder jedes Mal)\"},\r\n    {L\"Files dragged out of the island are:\", L\"Aus der Insel herausgezogene Dateien werden:\"},\r\n    {L\"Fill\", L\"Füllung\"},\r\n    {L\"Fill animation\", L\"Füllanimation\"},\r\n    {L\"Finding your location…\", L\"Dein Standort wird gesucht…\"},\r\n    {L\"Finish\", L\"Fertig\"},\r\n    {L\"Finish keeps all of it; Cancel puts back what was there before\", L\"„Fertig“ behält alles; „Abbrechen“ stellt wieder her, was vorher war\"},\r\n    {L\"Fixed\", L\"Fest\"},\r\n    {L\"Fixed: joined to the top edge, keeping its room (the windows stay below it)\", L\"Fest: am oberen Rand angesetzt, behält ihren Platz (die Fenster bleiben darunter)\"},\r\n    {L\"Floating\", L\"Schwebend\"},\r\n    {L\"Fluent (online)\", L\"Fluent (online)\"},\r\n    {L\"Focus\", L\"Fokus\"},\r\n    {L\"Fog\", L\"Nebel\"},\r\n    {L\"Fold the apps with notifications into an arrow (out when one comes, and under the mouse)\", L\"Apps mit Benachrichtigungen zu einem Pfeil einklappen (aus bei neuer Meldung und unter der Maus)\"},\r\n    {L\"Folder\", L\"Ordner\"},\r\n    {L\"Folders\", L\"Ordner\"},\r\n    {L\"Folders and places\", L\"Ordner und Orte\"},\r\n    {L\"Folders and places (your shortcuts)\", L\"Ordner und Orte (Ihre Verknüpfungen)\"},\r\n    {L\"Folders mixed with files\", L\"Ordner mit Dateien gemischt\"},\r\n    {L\"Folds the app icons into an arrow, they come out for new ones or on hover\", L\"Klappt die App-Symbole zu einem Pfeil zusammen, bei neuen Meldungen oder Mauszeiger öffnen sie sich\"},\r\n    {L\"Following the bell\", L\"Der Glocke folgend\"},\r\n    {L\"Following the mouse is unavailable with notches on the main island.\", L\"Der Mausfolge-Modus ist mit Notches in der Hauptinsel nicht verfügbar.\"},\r\n    {L\"Follows Windows or forces a 24 hour or 12 hour clock\", L\"Folgt Windows oder erzwingt die 24- oder 12-Stunden-Uhr\"},\r\n    {L\"Follows Windows' measurement system or forces Celsius or Fahrenheit\", L\"Folgt dem Maßsystem von Windows oder erzwingt Celsius oder Fahrenheit\"},\r\n    {L\"Follows the line\", L\"Folgt der Zeile\"},\r\n    {L\"Follows the mouse\", L\"Folgt der Maus\"},\r\n    {L\"For OLED screens: the minimized line fades away after this long, back when the mouse reaches it\", L\"Für OLED-Bildschirme: Die minimierte Linie blendet nach dieser Zeit aus und kommt zurück, wenn die Maus sie erreicht\"},\r\n    {L\"Forget\", L\"Entfernen\"},\r\n    {L\"Forget it?\", L\"Entfernen?\"},\r\n    {L\"Frames a second\", L\"Bilder pro Sekunde\"},\r\n    {L\"Freezing drizzle\", L\"Gefrierender Nieselregen\"},\r\n    {L\"Freezing rain\", L\"Gefrierender Regen\"},\r\n    {L\"Frequency\", L\"Frequenz\"},\r\n    {L\"From square to fully round corners (not with the bar or notches)\", L\"Von eckig bis ganz rund (nicht mit Leiste oder Notches)\"},\r\n    {L\"Frosted glass on the bar and the Fixed style's strip\", L\"Milchglas auf der Leiste und der festen Leiste\"},\r\n    {L\"Frosted look for the bar and the Fixed strip, needs Windows transparency\", L\"Milchglas-Optik für die Leiste und die feste Leiste, braucht Windows-Transparenz\"},\r\n    {L\"Games in exclusive full screen still draw over it. In some games it can cost some performance, or bother anti-cheat systems\", L\"Spiele im exklusiven Vollbild zeichnen weiterhin darüber. In manchen Spielen kann es etwas Leistung kosten oder Anti-Cheat-Systeme stören\"},\r\n    {L\"Gap between the pill and the screen edge (not with the bar or notches)\", L\"Abstand zwischen Kapsel und Bildschirmrand (nicht mit Leiste oder Notches)\"},\r\n    {L\"General\", L\"Allgemein\"},\r\n    {L\"Gives chosen apps their own icons, clock and order while they're in front (in the Island style, their own spot too). Each style has its own list\", L\"Gibt ausgewählten Apps eigene Symbole, Uhr und Reihenfolge, solange sie im Vordergrund sind (im Inselstil auch eine eigene Position). Jeder Stil hat seine eigene Liste\"},\r\n    {L\"Glass\", L\"Glas\"},\r\n    {L\"Glass blur\", L\"Glasunschärfe\"},\r\n    {L\"Glass: see-through and blurred, like on macOS\", L\"Glas: durchsichtig und unscharf, wie unter macOS\"},\r\n    {L\"Glass: see-through and blurred, with a bright edge (Windows' blur: needs its transparency effects)\", L\"Glas: durchsichtig und unscharf mit hellem Rand (Windows-Unschärfe: braucht dessen Transparenzeffekte)\"},\r\n    {L\"Glow and particles\", L\"Glanz und Partikel\"},\r\n    {L\"Graphite\", L\"Graphit\"},\r\n    {L\"Green\", L\"Grün\"},\r\n    {L\"Grid\", L\"Raster\"},\r\n    {L\"Grid columns\", L\"Rasterspalten\"},\r\n    {L\"Hard to read: too alike\", L\"Schwer lesbar: zu ähnlich\"},\r\n    {L\"Heavy rain\", L\"Starkregen\"},\r\n    {L\"Heroicons (online)\", L\"Heroicons (online)\"},\r\n    {L\"Hex\", L\"Hex\"},\r\n    {L\"Hibernate\", L\"Ruhezustand\"},\r\n    {L\"Hidden, a small pill with the time stays instead of the line (the line while a window is under it). The Bar hidden with Win+J closes into it too\", L\"Ausgeblendet bleibt statt der Linie eine kleine Kapsel mit der Uhrzeit (die Linie, solange ein Fenster darunter liegt). Auch die mit Win+J ausgeblendete Leiste schrumpft zu dieser Kapsel\"},\r\n    {L\"Hide a notch with nothing in it\", L\"Leere Aussparung ausblenden\"},\r\n    {L\"Hide after\", L\"Ausblenden nach\"},\r\n    {L\"Hide as its line until the mouse reaches it\", L\"Als Linie ausblenden, bis die Maus sie erreicht\"},\r\n    {L\"Hide each notch on its own (not all together)\", L\"Jedes Notch einzeln ausblenden (nicht alle zusammen)\"},\r\n    {L\"Hide past events after\", L\"Vergangene Termine ausblenden nach\"},\r\n    {L\"Hide the Windows banners\", L\"Windows-Banner ausblenden\"},\r\n    {L\"Hides when the mouse leaves, or only while a window is maximized or over it\", L\"Versteckt sich, wenn die Maus geht, oder nur solange ein Fenster maximiert ist oder darüber liegt\"},\r\n    {L\"Hiding\", L\"Ausblenden\"},\r\n    {L\"Hiding and notifications\", L\"Ausblenden und Benachrichtigungen\"},\r\n    {L\"Hiding: when and how it becomes the line\", L\"Ausblenden: wann und wie sie zur Linie wird\"},\r\n    {L\"Highlight behind the item under the mouse\", L\"Hervorhebung hinter dem Element unter der Maus\"},\r\n    {L\"Hold Ctrl and drag an item on the island (in any style) to another place, or to another notch. Its items jiggle while Ctrl is held with the mouse on it\", L\"Halte Strg gedrückt und ziehe ein Element auf der Insel (in jedem Stil) an eine andere Stelle oder in eine andere Aussparung. Solange Strg gedrückt ist und die Maus auf ihr liegt, wackeln ihre Elemente\"},\r\n    {L\"Holidays in the calendar (goes online)\", L\"Feiertage im Kalender (online)\"},\r\n    {L\"Home folder\", L\"Basisordner\"},\r\n    {L\"Horizontal stack\", L\"Horizontal gestapelt\"},\r\n    {L\"How big the banner is, its texts and buttons with it\", L\"Wie groß das Banner ist, samt Texten und Schaltflächen\"},\r\n    {L\"How big the line is on the pill\", L\"Größe der Zeile in der Kapsel\"},\r\n    {L\"How big the previous, play and next buttons on the pill are, as far as the pill is tall\", L\"Wie groß die Tasten für Zurück, Wiedergabe und Weiter in der Kapsel sind, so weit die Kapsel hoch ist\"},\r\n    {L\"How it moves; paused it breathes, an error shakes, done flashes with a check, canceled drains back\", L\"Wie sie sich bewegt; pausiert atmet sie, Fehler lassen sie wackeln, Fertig blitzt mit Haken, Abbruch läuft zurück\"},\r\n    {L\"How many\", L\"Wie viele\"},\r\n    {L\"How many files it keeps: the oldest goes when a new one comes\", L\"Wie viele Dateien sie behält: die älteste geht, wenn eine neue kommt\"},\r\n    {L\"How many icons show before the list starts to scroll\", L\"Wie viele Symbole sichtbar sind, bevor die Liste scrollt\"},\r\n    {L\"How much of the AI agents' limits is used and when each starts over, read on this PC (no login and nothing online)\", L\"Wie viel der Limits der KI-Agenten verbraucht ist und wann jedes neu beginnt, auf diesem PC gelesen (ohne Anmeldung, nichts online)\"},\r\n    {L\"How much the bars move with the sound (they follow the playing app's own sound)\", L\"Wie stark die Balken auf den Ton reagieren (sie folgen dem Ton der wiedergebenden App)\"},\r\n    {L\"How round the banner's corners are\", L\"Wie rund die Ecken des Banners sind\"},\r\n    {L\"How round the notch curves are in the Fixed style\", L\"Wie rund die Notch-Kurven im festen Stil sind\"},\r\n    {L\"How solid the island's fill is, from see-through to full\", L\"Wie deckend die Füllung der Insel ist, von durchsichtig bis voll\"},\r\n    {L\"How strongly the glass blurs what is behind it\", L\"Wie stark das Glas den Hintergrund verwischt\"},\r\n    {L\"How tall the bars can grow (as far as the pill allows)\", L\"Wie hoch die Balken wachsen können (so weit die Kapsel es zulässt)\"},\r\n    {L\"How the What's playing panel looks: the usual one, Pixel (Android), One UI (Samsung), Windows 11, or only the cover with the buttons over it. It opens from What's playing or the cover on the pill\", L\"Wie das Wiedergabe-Panel aussieht: wie gewohnt, Pixel (Android), One UI (Samsung), Windows 11 oder nur das Cover mit den Tasten darüber. Es öffnet sich über „Wiedergabe“ oder das Cover in der Kapsel\"},\r\n    {L\"How visible the thin line is when the pill is hidden\", L\"Wie sichtbar die dünne Linie ist, wenn die Kapsel ausgeblendet ist\"},\r\n    {L\"How visible the thin outline around the pill is\", L\"Wie sichtbar der dünne Umriss der Kapsel ist\"},\r\n    {L\"How wide each bar is; the item grows with them\", L\"Wie breit jeder Balken ist; das Element wächst mit\"},\r\n    {L\"How wide the banner is (a longer text fits on its lines)\", L\"Wie breit das Banner ist (ein längerer Text passt in seine Zeilen)\"},\r\n    {L\"Humidity\", L\"Luftfeuchte\"},\r\n    {L\"Icon and color\", L\"Symbol und Farbe\"},\r\n    {L\"Icon colors\", L\"Symbolfarben\"},\r\n    {L\"Icon pack\", L\"Symbolpaket\"},\r\n    {L\"Icon size\", L\"Symbolgröße\"},\r\n    {L\"Iconoir (online)\", L\"Iconoir (online)\"},\r\n    {L\"Icons\", L\"Symbole\"},\r\n    {L\"Icons of the apps with notifications\", L\"Symbole der Apps mit Benachrichtigungen\"},\r\n    {L\"Icons per app (Bar)\", L\"Symbole pro App (Leiste)\"},\r\n    {L\"Icons per app (Fixed style)\", L\"Symbole pro App (fester Stil)\"},\r\n    {L\"Icons that aren't pinned\", L\"Nicht angeheftete Symbole\"},\r\n    {L\"Ignored (not counted)\", L\"Ignoriert (zählen nicht)\"},\r\n    {L\"Import\", L\"Importieren\"},\r\n    {L\"Import a backup of the island\", L\"Eine Sicherung der Insel importieren\"},\r\n    {L\"Import a file\", L\"Datei importieren\"},\r\n    {L\"Import shortcuts (like komorebi's whkdrc)\", L\"Tastenkombinationen importieren (wie whkdrc von komorebi)\"},\r\n    {L\"In the bar, sends items to the screen corners, clock in the middle\", L\"In der Leiste kommen Elemente in die Bildschirmecken, die Uhr in die Mitte\"},\r\n    {L\"In the island's Do not disturb, calls, alarms and reminders don't ring either (they still show on the pill)\", L\"Im „Nicht stören“ der Insel klingeln auch Anrufe, Wecker und Erinnerungen nicht (sie erscheinen weiter in der Kapsel)\"},\r\n    {L\"In the pill\", L\"In der Kapsel\"},\r\n    {L\"In the pill with a sound, even in Do not disturb\", L\"In der Kapsel mit Ton, auch bei „Nicht stören“\"},\r\n    {L\"In the terminal\", L\"Im Terminal\"},\r\n    {L\"In use\", L\"In Verwendung\"},\r\n    {L\"In use: close what's open on it\", L\"In Verwendung: Geöffnetes darauf schließen\"},\r\n    {L\"Installed apps\", L\"Installierte Apps\"},\r\n    {L\"Instrumental\", L\"Instrumental\"},\r\n    {L\"Ionicons (online)\", L\"Ionicons (online)\"},\r\n    {L\"Island\", L\"Insel\"},\r\n    {L\"Island backup (*.txt)\", L\"Inselsicherung (*.txt)\"},\r\n    {L\"Island font\", L\"Schriftart der Insel\"},\r\n    {L\"Island settings\", L\"Inseleinstellungen\"},\r\n    {L\"Island: a pill floating at the top, the windows go under it\", L\"Insel: eine oben schwebende Kapsel, die Fenster gehen darunter durch\"},\r\n    {L\"It couldn't start.\", L\"Es konnte nicht starten.\"},\r\n    {L\"It failed (see the terminal)\", L\"Fehlgeschlagen (siehe Terminal)\"},\r\n    {L\"It goes to the screen with the mouse\", L\"Sie wechselt zum Bildschirm mit der Maus\"},\r\n    {L\"Items in the bar\", L\"Elemente in der Leiste\"},\r\n    {L\"Items on the pill\", L\"Elemente in der Kapsel\"},\r\n    {L\"Its focus or break ending, while it runs\", L\"Ende von Fokus oder Pause, solange er läuft\"},\r\n    {L\"Its look (profile):\", L\"Sein Aussehen (Profil):\"},\r\n    {L\"Its style, size, hiding and animations are in Windhawk's settings for this mod\", L\"Stil, Größe, Ausblenden und Animationen stehen in den Windhawk-Einstellungen dieses Mods\"},\r\n    {L\"Keep as it is\", L\"Unverändert lassen\"},\r\n    {L\"Keep as it is: the items the pill had before\", L\"Unverändert lassen: die Elemente, die die Kapsel vorher hatte\"},\r\n    {L\"Keep it open\", L\"Offen halten\"},\r\n    {L\"Keep their list open\", L\"Liste geöffnet lassen\"},\r\n    {L\"Keeps the note on the pill when no app has media; a click opens the panel\", L\"Lässt die Note in der Kapsel, wenn keine App Medien hat; ein Klick öffnet das Panel\"},\r\n    {L\"Keyboard language\", L\"Tastatursprache\"},\r\n    {L\"Keyboard language (like Windows' input indicator)\", L\"Tastatursprache (wie die Eingabeanzeige von Windows)\"},\r\n    {L\"Keyboard shortcut (optional)\", L\"Tastenkürzel (optional)\"},\r\n    {L\"Keyboard shortcuts\", L\"Tastenkombinationen\"},\r\n    {L\"Keyboard shortcuts button\", L\"Schaltfläche Tastenkombinationen\"},\r\n    {L\"Keys\", L\"Tasten\"},\r\n    {L\"Language\", L\"Sprache\"},\r\n    {L\"Language of the island's texts (it starts again)\", L\"Sprache der Inseltexte (Neustart der Insel)\"},\r\n    {L\"Language of the notes\", L\"Sprache der Hinweise\"},\r\n    {L\"Language settings\", L\"Spracheinstellungen\"},\r\n    {L\"Large\", L\"Groß\"},\r\n    {L\"Largest first\", L\"Größte zuerst\"},\r\n    {L\"Later\", L\"Später\"},\r\n    {L\"Leaves only the play and pause button on the pill, without previous and next\", L\"Lässt nur die Wiedergabe-/Pause-Schaltfläche in der Kapsel, ohne Zurück und Weiter\"},\r\n    {L\"Leaves out komorebi workspaces that have no windows\", L\"Blendet komorebi-Arbeitsbereiche ohne Fenster aus\"},\r\n    {L\"Left\", L\"Links\"},\r\n    {L\"Less round\", L\"Weniger rund\"},\r\n    {L\"Let go to add it to your commands\", L\"Loslassen, um es zu deinen Befehlen hinzuzufügen\"},\r\n    {L\"Let go to put it on the shelf\", L\"Loslassen, um es in die Ablage zu legen\"},\r\n    {L\"Light\", L\"Hell\"},\r\n    {L\"Light and dark mode\", L\"Heller und dunkler Modus\"},\r\n    {L\"Light and dark mode button\", L\"Schaltfläche Heller/dunkler Modus\"},\r\n    {L\"Light and shadow like macOS 27\", L\"Licht und Schatten wie bei macOS 27\"},\r\n    {L\"Light rain\", L\"Leichter Regen\"},\r\n    {L\"Lighter tint and livelier colors on the glass\", L\"Hellerer Farbton und lebendigere Farben auf dem Glas\"},\r\n    {L\"Lights up the item the mouse is over\", L\"Hebt das Element unter der Maus hervor\"},\r\n    {L\"Like Ctrl+Shift+S, or Ctrl+K, Ctrl+S\", L\"Wie Strg+Umschalt+S oder Strg+K, Strg+S\"},\r\n    {L\"Like Windows\", L\"Wie Windows\"},\r\n    {L\"Like the island\", L\"Wie die Insel\"},\r\n    {L\"Like the island: only the shapes of the emojis and of your pictures, in the island's colors. Their own: as they are\", L\"Wie die Insel: nur die Formen der Emojis und Ihrer Bilder, in den Farben der Insel. Eigene: wie sie sind\"},\r\n    {L\"Like the panels\", L\"Wie die Panels\"},\r\n    {L\"Line added · drag it between icons, click it to remove\", L\"Linie hinzugefügt · zwischen die Symbole ziehen, zum Entfernen anklicken\"},\r\n    {L\"Line opacity\", L\"Linientransparenz\"},\r\n    {L\"Line that opens the island\", L\"Linie, die die Insel öffnet\"},\r\n    {L\"Liquid wave\", L\"Flüssige Welle\"},\r\n    {L\"Loading...\", L\"Wird geladen...\"},\r\n    {L\"Location\", L\"Standort\"},\r\n    {L\"Location off or not allowed in Windows\", L\"Standort in Windows aus oder nicht erlaubt\"},\r\n    {L\"Lock\", L\"Sperren\"},\r\n    {L\"Logs\", L\"Protokolle\"},\r\n    {L\"Long\", L\"Lang\"},\r\n    {L\"Long notification texts scroll under the mouse\", L\"Lange Benachrichtigungstexte laufen unter der Maus\"},\r\n    {L\"Longest line on the pill\", L\"Zeilenlänge auf der Kapsel\"},\r\n    {L\"Longest width the song title may take on the pill\", L\"Maximale Breite des Songtitels in der Kapsel\"},\r\n    {L\"Look\", L\"Aussehen\"},\r\n    {L\"Look and dock\", L\"Aussehen und Dock\"},\r\n    {L\"Looking for networks...\", L\"Netzwerke werden gesucht...\"},\r\n    {L\"Looking for the lyrics…\", L\"Songtext wird gesucht…\"},\r\n    {L\"Looking…\", L\"Suche läuft…\"},\r\n    {L\"Looks for lyrics\", L\"Sucht Liedtexte\"},\r\n    {L\"Low battery\", L\"Akku schwach\"},\r\n    {L\"Lucide (online)\", L\"Lucide (online)\"},\r\n    {L\"Lyrics are looked for only for songs (with an artist, 45 s to 20 min, not videos)\", L\"Songtexte werden nur für Songs gesucht (mit Interpret, 45 s bis 20 min, keine Videos)\"},\r\n    {L\"Lyrics are off for this app (in the settings, What's playing)\", L\"Songtexte sind für diese App ausgeschaltet (in den Einstellungen, Was gerade läuft)\"},\r\n    {L\"Lyrics as an icon\", L\"Liedtext als Symbol\"},\r\n    {L\"Lyrics color\", L\"Songtextfarbe\"},\r\n    {L\"Lyrics color (own)\", L\"Songtextfarbe (eigene)\"},\r\n    {L\"Lyrics from lrclib.net\", L\"Songtext von lrclib.net\"},\r\n    {L\"Lyrics replace the song title\", L\"Songtext ersetzt den Titel\"},\r\n    {L\"Lyrics size\", L\"Songtextgröße\"},\r\n    {L\"Lyrics size on the pill\", L\"Songtextgröße in der Kapsel\"},\r\n    {L\"M D Y\", L\"M T J\"},\r\n    {L\"Made in Brazil, new versions bring fixes and what users ask for\", L\"In Brasilien gemacht, neue Versionen bringen Fixes und Nutzerwünsche\"},\r\n    {L\"Magnifier\", L\"Lupe\"},\r\n    {L\"Main island\", L\"Hauptinsel\"},\r\n    {L\"Makes the What's playing panel bigger than the other panels; on a short screen it still fits and scrolls\", L\"Macht das Wiedergabe-Panel größer als die anderen Panels; auf einem niedrigen Bildschirm passt es sich an und scrollt\"},\r\n    {L\"Makes the pill taller or shorter (not with the bar)\", L\"Macht die Kapsel höher oder niedriger (nicht mit Leiste)\"},\r\n    {L\"Manage profiles\", L\"Profile verwalten\"},\r\n    {L\"Marks holidays in the calendar, it needs an internet connection\", L\"Markiert Feiertage im Kalender, Internetverbindung nötig\"},\r\n    {L\"Material (online)\", L\"Material (online)\"},\r\n    {L\"Media buttons\", L\"Medientasten\"},\r\n    {L\"Media buttons on the pill\", L\"Medientasten in der Kapsel\"},\r\n    {L\"Media buttons size\", L\"Größe der Medientasten\"},\r\n    {L\"Media panel size\", L\"Größe des Medienpanels\"},\r\n    {L\"Media panel style\", L\"Stil des Medienpanels\"},\r\n    {L\"Medium\", L\"Mittel\"},\r\n    {L\"Memory\", L\"Speicher\"},\r\n    {L\"Memory use (RAM)\", L\"Speicherauslastung (RAM)\"},\r\n    {L\"Merges an app's notifications into one icon, Phone Link's phone apps included\", L\"Fasst die Benachrichtigungen einer App in einem Symbol zusammen, auch Handy-Apps von Phone Link\"},\r\n    {L\"Meteocons (colored)\", L\"Meteocons (farbig)\"},\r\n    {L\"Microphone\", L\"Mikrofon\"},\r\n    {L\"Microphone button (mute)\", L\"Mikrofon-Schaltfläche (stumm)\"},\r\n    {L\"Microphone, camera and location in use\", L\"Mikrofon, Kamera und Standort in Verwendung\"},\r\n    {L\"Microphone, camera and location in use (and which app)\", L\"Mikrofon, Kamera und Standort in Verwendung (und welche App)\"},\r\n    {L\"Middle\", L\"Mitte\"},\r\n    {L\"Minimize\", L\"Minimieren\"},\r\n    {L\"Minimize arrow at the end of the pill\", L\"Minimieren-Pfeil am Ende der Kapsel\"},\r\n    {L\"Missed\", L\"Verpasst\"},\r\n    {L\"Mixer\", L\"Mixer\"},\r\n    {L\"Mobile hotspot\", L\"Mobiler Hotspot\"},\r\n    {L\"Monitor\", L\"Monitor\"},\r\n    {L\"Monitor \", L\"Monitor \"},\r\n    {L\"Monitors\", L\"Monitore\"},\r\n    {L\"Monocle (the window in focus fills the screen)\", L\"Monokel (das Fenster im Fokus füllt den Bildschirm)\"},\r\n    {L\"Month as a number (9/10)\", L\"Monat als Zahl (9/10)\"},\r\n    {L\"More Windows controls\", L\"Weitere Windows-Steuerelemente\"},\r\n    {L\"More in Explorer\", L\"Mehr im Explorer\"},\r\n    {L\"More options in: %s\", L\"Weitere Optionen unter: %s\"},\r\n    {L\"Mostly clear\", L\"Überwiegend klar\"},\r\n    {L\"Mouse away\", L\"Maus weg\"},\r\n    {L\"Move\", L\"Verschieben\"},\r\n    {L\"Move the pill by dragging it\", L\"Kapsel durch Ziehen verschieben\"},\r\n    {L\"Moved\", L\"Verschoben\"},\r\n    {L\"Music\", L\"Musik\"},